window.__ecmStrMap = {
  "A contract of employment can be in writing, expressed or implied; but an employer must issue a written document evidencing the contract before employment starts.": "劳动合同可以以书面形式订立，也可以明示或默示成立；但雇主必须在用工开始前出具书面文件以证明合同的存在。",
  "A contract of service can be express or implied, oral or written. But for employment of any servant or worker in any trade or occupation, a written contract is safest.": "服务合同可以是明示或默示的，口头或书面的。但对于任何行业或职业中雇用佣人或工人的情况，书面合同最为稳妥。",
  "A contract of service can exist without writing, but the employer must inform the employee of its terms. Written contracts are strongly recommended.": "服务合同可以在没有书面形式的情况下成立，但雇主必须将合同条款告知雇员。强烈建议采用书面合同。",
  "A copy of fixed-term contracts must be sent to the employment centre within 5 business days.": "固定期限合同副本必须在5个工作日内发送至就业中心。",
  "A normal employment contract can be verbal or written. Written form is required for some contract types/clauses, so a written contract is safest.": "普通劳动合同可以是口头或书面形式。某些合同类型/条款需要书面形式，因此书面合同最为稳妥。",
  "A normal employment contract can exist without a full written contract, but the employer must provide written proof of the essential employment terms under the Nachweisgesetz.": "普通劳动合同可以在没有完整书面合同的情况下成立，但雇主必须依据《书面证明法》（Nachweisgesetz）提供基本劳动条款的书面证明。",
  "A signed employment agreement is not always required, but employer must give written notice of working conditions unless the employment agreement already includes all required items.": "并非总是需要签署劳动协议，但雇主必须以书面形式告知工作条件，除非劳动协议已包含所有必要事项。",
  "A valid 90-day trial period must be agreed in writing before the employee starts work, and employer must have fewer than 20 employees to use it for dismissal purposes. After 2025 law, the 90-day trial has been extended to all employers.": "有效的90天试用期必须在雇员开始工作前以书面形式约定，且雇主须少于20名雇员方可将其用于解雇目的。根据2025年修订法律，90天试用期已扩展适用于所有雇主。",
  "A verbal contract can be valid, but important terms like probation should be written or the employer may not be able to rely on them.": "口头合同可以有效，但试用期等重要条款应以书面形式约定，否则雇主可能无法依据此类条款主张权利。",
  "A verbal contract can exist, but do not rely on memory. Give the written terms on time and clearly state fixed-term reason, pay, hours, leave and notice.": "口头合同可以成立，但不要依赖记忆。应及时提供书面条款，并清楚说明固定期限原因、薪酬、工时、假期和通知期。",
  "Agreement should include parties, employer/employee information, type of work, workplace, working hours, start date, duration if fixed, probation if any, wages, overtime, leave, notice/termination terms, benefits, and other agreed conditions per the Employment and Skills Development Law.": "协议应根据《就业和技能发展法》包含以下内容：双方当事人、雇主/雇员信息、工作类型、工作地点、工作时间、入职日期、固定期限（如适用）、试用期（如有）、工资、加班、假期、通知/终止条款、福利及其他约定条件。",
  "Agreement should include parties, workplace, job title/description, first day, contract period, holiday rights, notice, wages, working hours, pension fund and applicable collective agreement.": "协议应包含：双方当事人、工作地点、职务名称/描述、入职首日、合同期限、假期权利、通知期、工资、工作时间、养老金基金及适用的集体协议。",
  "Allowed if agreed in the employment contract. Do not assume probation applies if it is not written.": "若劳动合同中有约定则允许设置试用期。若未以书面形式约定，不得假定试用期适用。",
  "Allowed only if agreed and within legal/CBA limits. Put it clearly in writing.": "仅在双方约定且符合法律/CBA限制的情况下方可允许。应以书面形式明确约定。",
  "Allowed, but fixed-term use and renewal must follow the Labour Code. State the term clearly.": "允许，但固定期限合同的使用和续签必须遵循《劳动法典》。应明确说明合同期限。",
  "Allowed. Fixed-term contract duration, including extensions, should be clearly stated and monitored.": "允许。固定期限合同的期限（包括延期）应明确说明并加以监控。",
  "Allowed. Fixed-term contracts should state the term clearly; common official template wording allows renewal by agreement, with a 5-year cap for fixed terms.": "允许。固定期限合同应明确说明期限；常见官方模板措辞允许经协议续签，固定期限合同最长不超过5年。",
  "Allowed. If employment is not indefinite, state the expected period or fixed end date.": "允许。若非无固定期限用工，应注明预计用工期限或固定终止日期。",
  "Any weaker term than Kuwait Labour Law is invalid unless it gives the worker a better benefit.": "任何低于科威特《劳动法》标准的条款均无效，除非该条款给予工人更优厚的待遇。",
  "Any written employment contract must be in French. If the employee is foreign, they can request a translation; if versions conflict, the employee-language version protects the employee.": "任何书面劳动合同必须以法语书写。若雇员为外籍人员，可申请翻译版本；若两个版本存在冲突，以雇员所用语言版本保护雇员权益。",
  "Applicable collective agreement can be referenced and may set pay, level, leave, notice and other minimum terms.": "可参引适用的集体协议，该协议可规定薪酬、级别、假期、通知期及其他最低标准条款。",
  "Appointment letter at appointment. Service book at engagement and kept updated.": "录用时发放录用通知书。入职时发放服务手册并持续更新。",
  "Appointment letter is required for every employee under the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020.": "根据2020年《职业安全、健康和工作条件法典》，每位雇员均须获得录用通知书。",
  "Appointment letter is required for every worker under national employment legislation. Where standing orders apply, the employer must issue a service book.": "根据国家就业法规，每位工人均须获得录用通知书。在适用常规规则的情况下，雇主必须发放服务手册。",
  "Appointment letter is required. Employer cannot hire a worker without giving an appointment letter, and must also give a photo ID card.": "须提供录用通知书。雇主不得在未发放录用通知书的情况下雇用工人，并且还必须发放附照片的身份证件。",
  "Appointment letter must use the information/form prescribed by the appropriate government. Practical terms: role, wages, working hours, leave, notice, work location, benefits and employment category.": "录用通知书必须使用相关政府规定的信息/表格。实际条款应包括：职务、工资、工作时间、假期、通知期、工作地点、福利及用工类别。",
  "Appointment letter should confirm category, job, start date, pay, and key employment terms. Service book should record service history and conditions.": "录用通知书应确认类别、职务、入职日期、薪酬及主要劳动条款。服务手册应记录服务历史和条件。",
  "Arabic is required or must be accompanied by Arabic translation. English/Arabic bilingual is common for expatriate workers.": "须使用阿拉伯语，或须附阿拉伯语译本。英语/阿拉伯语双语合同在外籍工人中很常见。",
  "Arabic is required. If the worker is not Arab, another approved foreign-language copy must be prepared.": "须使用阿拉伯语。若工人非阿拉伯人，必须另行准备经批准的外语副本。",
  "Arabic is safest because the official law and labour administration are in Arabic. Bilingual may be used, but Arabic should control locally.": "使用阿拉伯语最为稳妥，因为官方法律和劳工行政均以阿拉伯语为准。可使用双语，但阿拉伯语应在当地具有控制效力。",
  "Arabic is the controlling language in the official LMRA bilingual contract template. English can be attached, but Arabic prevails if there is a dispute.": "在LMRA官方双语合同模板中，阿拉伯语为控制语言。可附英语版本，但发生争议时以阿拉伯语为准。",
  "Arabic is the key contract language. If bilingual, Arabic should control if there is a conflict.": "阿拉伯语是合同的主要语言。若为双语合同，发生冲突时应以阿拉伯语为准。",
  "Arabic is the official language and should control. Bilingual English/Arabic contracts are common, but Arabic prevails in disputes.": "阿拉伯语是官方语言，应具有控制效力。英语/阿拉伯语双语合同很常见，但发生争议时以阿拉伯语为准。",
  "Arabic is the official language. French is widely used in business in Morocco. For local enforcement, an Arabic version is safest.": "阿拉伯语是官方语言。法语在摩洛哥商业中广泛使用。为便于当地执行，使用阿拉伯语版本最为稳妥。",
  "Arabic is the required official language for official forms and enforcement. Bilingual contracts are common for expatriate employees.": "阿拉伯语是官方表格和执法所需的官方语言。双语合同在外籍雇员中很常见。",
  "Arabic should be the controlling language. An Arabic version or translation should be attached for contracts with foreign workers.": "阿拉伯语应为控制语言。与外籍工人签订的合同应附阿拉伯语版本或译本。",
  "As soon as possible and at the latest 1 month after work starts for employment exceeding 1 month. Before work starts if employment is under 1 month or temporary staffing.": "尽快提供，且对于超过1个月的用工，最迟应在开始工作后1个月内提供。若用工期限不足1个月或属于临时人员派遣，应在工作开始前提供。",
  "At hiring / before employment starts, because the law says a worker cannot be employed without the appointment letter.": "在录用时/用工开始前提供，因为法律规定未发放录用通知书不得雇用工人。",
  "At minimum: type of work, place(s) of work and start date. In practice also include pay, working hours, leave, notice, probation, fixed-term status and CBA reference.": "最低要求：工作类型、工作地点及入职日期。实际操作中还应包括：薪酬、工作时间、假期、通知期、试用期、固定期限状态及CBA参引。",
  "At the start of employment. For some categories, the employer may need to give the written terms / contract at hiring.": "在用工开始时提供。对于某些类别，雇主可能需要在录用时提供书面条款/合同。",
  "At the start of employment; each party should keep a copy.": "在用工开始时提供；双方各应保留一份副本。",
  "At the start of the employment relationship.": "在劳动关系建立时提供。",
  "At the time of entering the labour contract. The written conditions must be issued at contract conclusion.": "在订立劳动合同时提供。书面条件必须在合同订立时发出。",
  "At the time the labour contract is made.": "在劳动合同订立时提供。",
  "Austria is not \"no paperwork\". Even if the contract is oral, the employee normally needs a written document showing the key terms.": "奥地利并非\"无需书面文件\"。即使合同为口头形式，雇员通常也需要一份载明主要条款的书面文件。",
  "Basic Conditions of Employment Act and Labour Relations Act set minimum employment rights. Contract cannot reduce them.": "《基本就业条件法》和《劳动关系法》规定了最低就业权利。合同不得削减这些权利。",
  "Before employment starts.": "在用工开始前提供。",
  "Before or when employment starts. Written contract should be signed by hand or digitally.": "在用工开始前或开始时提供。书面合同应以手写或数字方式签署。",
  "Before the employee starts work if using written confirmation. Employer must also give a copy of compulsory health and pension insurance application within 8 days after the insurance-application deadline.": "若使用书面确认书，应在雇员开始工作前提供。雇主还必须在保险申请截止日期后8天内提供强制医疗和养老保险申请的副本。",
  "Before the employee starts work.": "在雇员开始工作前提供。",
  "Before work starts / at contract signing. The employment relationship is created by the employment contract.": "在工作开始前/合同签署时提供。劳动关系由劳动合同创立。",
  "Before work starts for written contracts. For oral contracts of under 1 month, both parties must agree on the main terms orally beforehand.": "书面合同应在工作开始前提供。对于不足1个月的口头合同，双方必须事先口头约定主要条款。",
  "Before work starts — the contract must be registered in Revisal before the employee's first day.": "在工作开始前——合同必须在雇员入职第一天前在Revisal系统中登记。",
  "Before work starts. The employer must also issue an order/directive on employment.": "在工作开始前提供。雇主还必须发布用工命令/指令。",
  "Belgium is not just about the signed contract. Always check the sector CBA because it may set pay, notice, hours and benefits.": "比利时劳动关系不仅限于签署合同。应始终查阅行业CBA，因为其可能规定薪酬、通知期、工时和福利。",
  "Best practice: job title, wage rate, hours, benefits, allowances, leave, grounds for termination, probation if used, and applicable policies/CBAs.": "最佳实践：职务名称、工资率、工时、福利、津贴、假期、终止理由、试用期（如适用）及适用政策/CBA。",
  "Bulgaria is strict: sign first, notify NRA, then let the employee start. Do not reverse the order.": "保加利亚规定严格：先签署合同，通知国家税务局（NRA），再让雇员开始工作。不得颠倒顺序。",
  "Bulgarian is safest. Official local filing and labour inspection are in Bulgarian.": "使用保加利亚语最为稳妥。官方本地备案和劳动监察均以保加利亚语进行。",
  "CDD is only for a precise temporary task and legal cases. It cannot be used to fill a normal permanent job.": "CDD（固定期限合同）仅适用于明确的临时任务和法定情形。不得用于填补正常的永久性职位。",
  "CDD must be given to the employee no later than 2 working days after hiring.": "CDD（固定期限合同）必须在录用后不迟于2个工作日内交付给雇员。",
  "CDI is the normal contract type and may follow the form chosen by the parties. In practice, written is safest. CDD must be written and state the exact reason, or it may be treated as indefinite.": "CDI（无固定期限合同）是正常合同类型，可采用双方选择的形式。实际操作中，书面形式最为稳妥。CDD（固定期限合同）必须为书面形式并注明确切原因，否则可能被视为无固定期限合同。",
  "CLT allows indefinite, fixed-term and intermittent contracts. Fixed-term/experience contracts need clear wording and must follow CLT limits.": "CLT允许无固定期限、固定期限和间歇性合同。固定期限/试用合同需要明确措辞，并必须遵守CLT规定的限制。",
  "CLT, constitution, collective bargaining agreements and union rules can override weaker contract terms.": "CLT、宪法、集体谈判协议和工会规则可凌驾于较弱的合同条款之上。",
  "Can be agreed in the employment agreement. Keep within Labour Act 2017 limits.": "可在劳动协议中约定。须在《2017年劳动法》规定的限制范围内。",
  "Can be agreed; state clearly. Minimum wage still applies during probation (subject to exceptions under applicable rules).": "可以约定；应明确说明。试用期内最低工资标准仍然适用（适用规则下的例外情况除外）。",
  "Canada is split: federal rules apply only to federally regulated sectors; provinces/territories set many employment standards. Minimum standards override weaker contract terms.": "加拿大存在分权：联邦规则仅适用于联邦监管行业；各省/地区制定许多就业标准。最低标准凌驾于较弱的合同条款之上。",
  "Check whether the worker is subject to central or provincial industrial/employment rules — Pakistan's labour law is partly devolved to provinces.": "应核查工人是否受中央或省级工业/就业规则的约束——巴基斯坦劳动法部分权力已下放至各省。",
  "Chinese is safest for enforceability. Local official guidance supports electronic contracts if the worker can access, download/print and receive a copy when requested.": "使用中文最有利于合同执行。若工人能够访问、下载/打印并在请求时获得副本，当地官方指引支持使用电子合同。",
  "Collective wage agreements set minimum wages and terms. Employer and employee cannot agree to lower wages or worse terms than the applicable CBA.": "集体工资协议规定最低工资和条款。雇主和雇员不得约定低于适用CBA的工资或更差的条款。",
  "Company rules on pay, working time, rest, safety, insurance, training and discipline must be lawfully made and made known to employees.": "公司关于薪酬、工时、休息、安全、保险、培训和纪律的规章制度必须依法制定并向雇员公示。",
  "Contract can be verbal, written or electronic. If key terms are not already in a written contract, the employer must give a written statement of the principal terms.": "合同可以是口头、书面或电子形式。若主要条款尚未载入书面合同，雇主必须提供主要条款的书面说明。",
  "Contract duration/type must be stated: indefinite, fixed-term, specific work or piece-rate/contract work as applicable.": "必须注明合同期限/类型：无固定期限、固定期限、特定工作或计件/承包工作（视情况而定）。",
  "Contract may be verbal or written, but fixed-term arrangements and special terms should be documented clearly.": "合同可以是口头或书面形式，但固定期限安排和特殊条款应明确记录。",
  "Contract must be concluded and signed before the employee starts work. The employer must submit the employee data to the Central Registry before work starts.": "合同必须在雇员开始工作前订立并签署。雇主必须在工作开始前将雇员数据提交至中央登记处。",
  "Contract must be concluded and signed before work starts. Employer must register the worker with the pension/disability insurance authority (ZPIZ) before work starts.": "合同必须在工作开始前订立并签署。雇主必须在工作开始前向养老金/残障保险机构（ZPIZ）登记工人。",
  "Contract must be concluded before work starts. After conclusion, each party receives a copy.": "合同必须在工作开始前订立。订立后，双方各获得一份副本。",
  "Contract must be in the official language. If a foreign employee does not understand it well enough, the employer must also explain the terms in a language they understand.": "合同必须使用官方语言。若外籍雇员理解程度不够，雇主还必须以其能够理解的语言解释合同条款。",
  "Contract must be prepared and approved as part of the work-permit/entry visa process before the employee arrives or starts work.": "合同必须作为工作许可/入境签证流程的一部分，在雇员抵达或开始工作前准备并获得批准。",
  "Contract must be signed before work starts, and employer must notify Sodra at least 1 working day before the employee starts.": "合同必须在工作开始前签署，且雇主必须在雇员开始工作前至少1个工作日通知Sodra（社会保险局）。",
  "Contract should be in place before employment starts or at the latest on the first day of work.": "合同应在用工开始前签订，最迟应在入职第一天签订。",
  "Contract should be provided before the employee starts work or, for foreign workers, before departure from home country.": "合同应在雇员开始工作前提供，对于外籍工人，应在其离开本国前提供。",
  "Contract should be signed before work starts; non-Saudi workers have their contracts processed through official platforms before arrival in Saudi Arabia.": "合同应在工作开始前签署；非沙特工人的合同应在抵达沙特阿拉伯前通过官方平台处理。",
  "Contract should clearly state role, pay, hours, location, employment type, leave, notice and policies. It cannot reduce NES, award or enterprise agreement rights.": "合同应明确说明职务、薪酬、工时、工作地点、用工类型、假期、通知期和政策。不得削减NES（全国就业标准）、奖励或企业协议赋予的权利。",
  "Contract should state parties, job, workplace, start date, wages, working hours, leave, contract type, term/end date if fixed, and termination rules.": "合同应注明：双方当事人、职务、工作地点、入职日期、工资、工作时间、假期、合同类型、固定期限/终止日期（如适用）及终止规则。",
  "Contract should state parties, job/workplace, start date, contract term, wage, working time, leave, employee/employer obligations, probation if any, termination and end-of-service terms.": "合同应注明：双方当事人、职务/工作地点、入职日期、合同期限、工资、工作时间、假期、雇员/雇主义务、试用期（如有）、终止及服务终止条款。",
  "Contract should state parties, job/workplace, wage, start date, duration if limited-term, notice, work conditions and any agreed IP/confidentiality terms.": "合同应注明：双方当事人、职务/工作地点、工资、入职日期、有限期限（如适用）、通知期、工作条件及任何约定的IP/保密条款。",
  "Contract terms cannot go below Finnish employment law or the applicable collective agreement. A conflicting weaker term can be invalid.": "合同条款不得低于芬兰劳动法或适用集体协议的标准。与之冲突的较弱条款可能无效。",
  "Contract terms cannot go below the Employment Ordinance or Minimum Wage Ordinance. Any term reducing those rights is void.": "合同条款不得低于《雇佣条例》或《最低工资条例》的标准。任何削减上述权利的条款均属无效。",
  "Contract terms cannot reduce rights under Labour Law No. 14 of 2025 and social insurance rules.": "合同条款不得削减《2025年第14号劳动法》及社会保险规则赋予的权利。",
  "Contract terms cannot reduce statutory labour-code, wage, safety, social security or applicable state-level rights.": "合同条款不得削减法定劳动法典、工资、安全、社会保障或适用的州级权利。",
  "Contract terms cannot remove statutory labour rights. Collective agreements may add stronger terms.": "合同条款不得剥夺法定劳动权利。集体协议可增加更有利的条款。",
  "Contract terms must follow Lao labour law and social insurance rules. Foreign workers must also follow work permit / labour administration rules.": "合同条款须遵守老挝劳动法及社会保险规定。外籍员工还须遵守工作许可证及劳动行政管理规定。",
  "Contract terms must not violate Bahrain Labour Law or the official employment offer/contract rules.": "合同条款不得违反巴林劳动法或官方雇用要约/合同规定。",
  "Contract terms on wages/rights cannot be lower than company regulations, collective labour agreement or laws.": "合同中关于工资/权利的条款不得低于公司规章制度、集体劳动协议或法律规定。",
  "Contract, CBA, and work rules cannot reduce employee rights below the law.": "合同、CBA及工作规则不得将员工权利降低至法律标准以下。",
  "Core terms must be given within 5 days after employment starts. Full written statement must be given within 1 month.": "核心条款须于入职后5天内提供。完整书面说明须于1个月内提供。",
  "Costa Rica is paperwork-heavy: prepare 3 signed copies and file one with the labour authority.": "哥斯达黎加文件要求繁琐：需准备3份签署副本，并向劳动主管部门备案一份。",
  "Croatia expects written paperwork before work starts. Fixed-term should not be used as the default unless there is a real reason.": "克罗地亚要求在开始工作前完成书面文件。除非有正当理由，否则不应将固定期限合同作为默认选项。",
  "Croatian is safest. Official English guidance does not state a general foreign-language allowance.": "克罗地亚语最为稳妥。官方英文指引未规定一般性外语豁免条款。",
  "Cyprus relies strongly on collective agreements and labour laws for minimum terms. Contract cannot be used to avoid statutory rights.": "塞浦路斯的最低条款在很大程度上依赖集体协议和劳动法。合同不得用于规避法定权利。",
  "Czech contracts are simple at minimum, but the 3 core items must be clear: job, workplace and start date.": "捷克合同最低要求较简单，但必须明确3项核心内容：职位、工作地点和入职日期。",
  "Czech is safest. Bilingual can be used, but Czech wording is practical for local enforcement and employee understanding.": "捷克语最为稳妥。可使用双语版本，但捷克语表述对本地执行和员工理解更具实用性。",
  "Danish labour market relies heavily on collective agreements. If a CBA applies, the contract usually references it.": "丹麦劳动市场高度依赖集体协议。如适用CBA，合同通常应予以引用。",
  "Day 1 statement must include: employer/employee details, start date, continuous employment start date, job title or description, workplace or work locations, pay and pay interval, working hours, holiday entitlement, sick pay, pension scheme, notice periods, and whether the role is permanent/fixed-term. Additional items may be provided within 2 months.": "第1天声明须包含：雇主/雇员信息、入职日期、连续雇佣起始日期、职务名称或职位描述、工作地点或工作场所、薪酬及发薪周期、工作时间、假期权利、病假工资、养老金计划、通知期，以及职位是否为长期/固定期限。其他内容可于2个月内提供。",
  "Day 5 terms include parties, employer address, workplace, role, start date, probation, fixed-term end date, pay, normal hours and overtime terms. Full statement adds leave, sick/incapacity terms, pension, notice, collective agreements and other required items.": "第5天条款包括：当事方、雇主地址、工作地点、职位、入职日期、试用期、固定期限终止日期、薪酬、标准工时及加班条款。完整说明另需增加假期、病假/失能条款、养老金、通知期、集体协议及其他必要内容。",
  "Default first month of indefinite employment is a probation period. Can be changed by agreement or CBA up to a maximum of 3 months.": "无固定期限雇用的默认第一个月为试用期。可通过协议或CBA调整，但最长不超过3个月。",
  "Default is indefinite employment unless parties agree otherwise. Fixed-term terms should be written clearly.": "除双方另有约定外，默认为无固定期限雇用。固定期限条款应以书面形式明确约定。",
  "Default is indefinite employment. Fixed-term is allowed only if the term is written and the nature of the work reasonably justifies it. Employer bears proof.": "默认为无固定期限雇用。固定期限雇用须以书面形式约定，且工作性质须有合理依据。举证责任由雇主承担。",
  "Default is indefinite. Fixed-term contract needs a good temporary reason related to the nature of the work.": "默认为无固定期限。固定期限合同须有与工作性质相关的正当临时原因。",
  "Definite/fixed-term contracts must state the end date or expected duration. Repeated fixed-term use has limits.": "固定期限合同须注明终止日期或预期期限。反复使用固定期限合同有一定限制。",
  "Do not confuse \"contract can exist\" with \"no paperwork needed\". Germany requires written proof of key employment terms.": "请勿将\"合同可以存在\"与\"无需书面文件\"相混淆。德国要求提供关键雇用条款的书面证明。",
  "Do not delay paperwork. In Chile, the contract must be written quickly and registered online.": "请勿拖延文件处理。在智利，合同须尽快以书面形式订立并在线登记。",
  "Do not let anyone start work before the written Latvian contract is ready. Probation and fixed-term wording must be written, not assumed.": "在书面拉脱维亚合同准备就绪之前，任何人不得开始工作。试用期和固定期限条款须以书面形式约定，不得默认推定。",
  "Do not rely on \"no written contract required\" as a reason to skip documentation. Use a clear written contract, especially for fixed-term, probation, pay and CBA terms.": "请勿以\"无需书面合同\"为由省略文件。应使用明确的书面合同，尤其是固定期限、试用期、薪酬及CBA条款。",
  "Do not treat probation as a reason to skip the contract. The written contract is still needed within 1 month.": "请勿以试用期为由省略合同。书面合同仍须于1个月内完成。",
  "Do not use one Canada answer for everyone. First check whether the worker is federal or provincial/territorial.": "请勿对加拿大所有情况一概而论。首先须确认该员工适用联邦还是省/地区管辖。",
  "Do not wait to prepare paperwork. Ireland requires a short written Day 5 statement first, then a fuller written statement within 1 month.": "请勿推迟文件准备。爱尔兰要求首先提供简短的书面第5天声明，然后在1个月内提供更完整的书面说明。",
  "Dutch is safest for local enforceability; bilingual contracts are common for international companies, but Dutch governs locally.": "荷兰语对本地执行最为稳妥；跨国公司通常使用双语合同，但本地以荷兰语为准。",
  "Dutch/French/German may apply depending on workplace/region. For local enforceability, use the correct local language or bilingual wording.": "视工作地点/地区而定，可能适用荷兰语/法语/德语。为确保本地可执行性，应使用正确的本地语言或双语表述。",
  "Employee must receive a written statement of employment conditions.": "员工须收到书面雇用条件说明。",
  "Employee name/age/address/sex, employer name, job description, start date, contract type/duration, workplace, hours, pay and pay interval, benefits, leave, sick pay, pension, notice, fixed-term end date, CBA if applicable, and outside-Kenya work terms if relevant.": "员工姓名/年龄/地址/性别、雇主名称、职位描述、入职日期、合同类型/期限、工作地点、工时、薪酬及发薪周期、福利、假期、病假工资、养老金、通知期、固定期限终止日期、适用CBA（如有），以及在肯尼亚境外工作的相关条款（如适用）。",
  "Employee/employer details, start date, fixed-term duration if any, workplace/remote or variable workplace, occupation/job description, pay and pay date, working time, annual leave, notice rules, CBA/work rules, probation if used, training rights, and social-security information.": "员工/雇主信息、入职日期、固定期限（如有）、工作地点/远程或可变工作地点、职业/职位描述、薪酬及发薪日期、工作时间、年假、通知规则、CBA/工作规则、试用期（如适用）、培训权利及社会保险信息。",
  "Employer must complete the DPAE pre-employment declaration to Urssaf within the required pre-hire window. No general filing of the contract itself found for ordinary CDI/CDD.": "雇主须在规定的入职前窗口期内向Urssaf完成DPAE入职前申报。普通CDI/CDD合同本身无需一般性备案。",
  "Employer must comply with registration and filing requirements under the Employment and Skills Development Law and related rules. New hires should be notified to the relevant labour office.": "雇主须遵守《就业和技能发展法》及相关规定的登记和备案要求。新员工入职应通知相关劳动行政部门。",
  "Employer must conclude the written employment contract and notify the State Social Insurance Fund Board (Sodra) at least 1 working day before work starts.": "雇主须订立书面劳动合同，并至少在员工开始工作前1个工作日通知国家社会保险基金委员会（Sodra）。",
  "Employer must give the employee a written document with key terms within 2 months of work starting if no written contract was signed.": "如未签署书面合同，雇主须于员工开始工作后2个月内向员工提供载有关键条款的书面文件。",
  "Employer must give the employee written working conditions and keep employment records. Normal labour insurance and NHI/pension registration duties apply.": "雇主须向员工提供书面工作条件并保存雇用记录。须履行常规劳工保险及全民健保/养老金登记义务。",
  "Employer must inform the employee in writing about the essential terms of the contract or employment relationship. It can be hard copy or electronic if the employee can access, store and print it.": "雇主须以书面形式告知员工合同或劳动关系的基本条款。可为纸质版或电子版，但员工须能访问、存储和打印。",
  "Employer must inform the employee of employment conditions in writing. This can be in the written employment contract, job offer, or another written document.": "雇主须以书面形式告知员工雇用条件。可通过书面劳动合同、录用通知或其他书面文件实现。",
  "Employer must keep a record of employment contracts and present them to authorities if requested.": "雇主须保存劳动合同记录，并在相关部门要求时予以出示。",
  "Employer must keep an employee roster for inspection. No general contract filing found in the cited national contract law article.": "雇主须保存员工名册以备检查。所引用的国家合同法条款中未发现一般性合同备案要求。",
  "Employer must maintain worker records/registers under the Labour Act. Separate factory/establishment registration may apply depending on business type.": "雇主须依据劳动法维护员工档案/登记册。根据业务类型，可能另需进行工厂/机构登记。",
  "Employer must notify the National Revenue Agency within 3 days of signing and before the employee starts work.": "雇主须在签署合同后3天内且员工开始工作前通知国家税务局。",
  "Employer must preserve the written employment contract during employment and for 10 years after expiry.": "雇主须在雇用期间及合同到期后10年内妥善保存书面劳动合同。",
  "Employer must register each worker with IMSS before they start work.": "雇主须在每位员工开始工作前向IMSS进行登记。",
  "Employer must register employee with ZPIZ before work starts. The registration number must be included in the contract.": "雇主须在员工开始工作前向ZPIZ进行登记。登记号码须载入合同。",
  "Employer must register employment contracts on the Dirección del Trabajo electronic site within 15 days after signing.": "雇主须在签署合同后15天内在Dirección del Trabajo电子平台登记劳动合同。",
  "Employer must register employment/payroll information, commonly through digital labour card/eSocial systems.": "雇主须登记雇用/薪资信息，通常通过数字劳动卡/eSocial系统办理。",
  "Employer must register the company's internal labour regulations with the provincial/city Department of Labour. Normal social insurance and tax registrations apply.": "雇主须将公司内部劳动规章向省/市人力资源和社会保障局备案。须履行常规社会保险及税务登记义务。",
  "Employer must register the employment contract in Revisal (General Register of Employees) before work starts. There is a specific user guide for this.": "雇主须在员工开始工作前将劳动合同登记于Revisal（员工总登记册）。对此有专门的用户指南。",
  "Employer must register the employment relationship with the state tax authority (notify) before work starts. Social insurance registration and record-keeping duties also apply.": "雇主须在员工开始工作前向国家税务机关登记（申报）劳动关系。社会保险登记及记录保存义务同样适用。",
  "Employer must register the worker with ARCA from the start of the relationship.": "雇主须自劳动关系建立之日起向ARCA登记员工信息。",
  "Employer must retain a signed copy of the employment agreement. The employer must keep a signed copy, and each employee must have a copy.": "雇主须保留一份已签署的劳动合同副本。雇主须保存一份签署副本，每位员工亦须持有一份。",
  "Employer must send one contract copy to the Ministry of Labour Employment Office within 15 days.": "雇主须于15天内将一份合同副本提交劳动部就业局。",
  "Employer must submit a hiring notification to the Central Register of Compulsory Social Insurance (Centralni registar) before work starts.": "雇主须在员工开始工作前向强制社会保险中央登记处（Centralni registar）提交招聘通知。",
  "Employer uses ERGANI for employment declarations such as recruitment, working hours, salary table updates and part-time/short-time registrations.": "雇主通过ERGANI系统办理雇用申报，包括招聘、工作时间、薪资表更新及兼职/短时工作登记。",
  "Employer/employee business location, start date, fixed-term end/reason, trial period, workplace, duties, pay/pay period, working hours, variable-hours terms, training, annual holiday, notice, CBA, pension and accident insurance details.": "雇主/雇员营业地点、入职日期、固定期限终止日期/原因、试用期、工作地点、职责、薪酬/发薪周期、工作时间、弹性工时条款、培训、年假、通知期、CBA、养老金及意外伤害保险详情。",
  "Employer/employee details, start date, duration, workplace, job description, probation, pay and payment method, working time, breaks/rest, overtime, leave, training, pension provider, termination process/notice and CBA/company agreement reference.": "雇主/雇员信息、入职日期、合同期限、工作地点、职位描述、试用期、薪酬及支付方式、工作时间、休息/休假、加班、假期、培训、养老金提供方、终止程序/通知期及CBA/公司协议参考。",
  "Employers with 10 or more regular workers must prepare and file work rules with the labour authority.": "拥有10名及以上正式员工的雇主须制定工作规则并向劳动主管部门备案。",
  "Employment / labour procedures are handled through the Public Authority for Manpower systems. Keep signed contract copies and use official forms/procedures where required.": "就业/劳动手续通过劳动力公共管理局系统办理。须保存已签署的合同副本，并在规定情况下使用官方表格/程序。",
  "Employment Act 1955 sets statutory minimum rights for applicable workers. Contract terms below these are unenforceable.": "《1955年雇佣法》为适用员工规定了法定最低权利。低于此标准的合同条款不具有法律效力。",
  "Employment Act Part IV thresholds and minimum provisions apply to covered employees. Contract terms below these are void.": "《雇佣法》第四部分的门槛和最低条款适用于受涵盖员工。低于此标准的合同条款无效。",
  "Employment Act minimum terms cannot be reduced by contract. CBA terms may be referenced if they are reasonably accessible to the employee.": "《雇佣法》最低条款不得通过合同予以降低。如员工能合理获取CBA条款，可在合同中引用。",
  "Employment Contracts Act minimums apply. CBA and work-organisation rules may add terms.": "《劳动合同法》最低标准适用。CBA及工作组织规则可增加相关条款。",
  "Employment Protection Act (LAS), applicable CBA and work rules set minimum rights.": "《雇佣保护法》（LAS）、适用的CBA及工作规则规定了最低权利标准。",
  "Employment Relationships Act minimum rights and applicable collective agreements set the floor.": "《劳动关系法》最低权利及适用集体协议构成底线要求。",
  "Employment Rights Act, Working Time Regulations, National Minimum Wage, and other legislation set minimum rights. Written statement cannot reduce them.": "《雇佣权利法》、《工作时间条例》、《国家最低工资法》及其他立法规定了最低权利标准。书面声明不得降低此类权利。",
  "Employment and Industrial Relations Act and applicable wage regulation orders set minimum rights.": "《就业与劳资关系法》及适用的工资规管令规定了最低权利标准。",
  "Employment can be for a specific purpose or duration, but terms and renewal must comply with the Workers' Rights Act.": "雇用可为特定目的或期限，但条款及续签须符合《工人权利法》的规定。",
  "Employment can start by agreement, but the employer must give the worker a written statement of the main contract terms.": "雇用关系可经协议开始，但雇主须向员工提供载有主要合同条款的书面说明。",
  "Employment contract can be oral or written, but employer must give the employee written information about essential employment conditions.": "劳动合同可为口头或书面形式，但雇主须向员工提供关于基本雇用条件的书面信息。",
  "Employment contract can be oral or written, indefinite or fixed-term. For at-will employment there is no specific form, but written is best. Fixed-term must be written.": "劳动合同可为口头或书面、无固定期限或固定期限。任意雇用无特定形式要求，但书面形式最佳。固定期限合同须为书面形式。",
  "Employment contract can be oral or written. Written form is required only if the law specifically says so or if the contract lasts for 1 year or longer.": "劳动合同可为口头或书面形式。仅在法律明确规定或合同期限为1年及以上时，方须采用书面形式。",
  "Employment contract can be verbal or written. Written form is not required for ordinary indefinite employment but is strongly recommended.": "劳动合同可为口头或书面形式。普通无固定期限雇用无需书面形式，但强烈建议采用书面形式。",
  "Employment contract can be written or verbal. Written contract is recommended but not always legally required.": "劳动合同可为书面或口头形式。建议采用书面合同，但并非始终具有法律强制要求。",
  "Employment contract is concluded in writing. If no signed contract exists, employer must give written confirmation before work starts.": "劳动合同须以书面形式订立。如不存在已签署的合同，雇主须在员工开始工作前提供书面确认。",
  "Employment contract is not required to be in writing for ordinary employment (though written is recommended). Written form is needed for fixed-term contracts and some special arrangements.": "普通雇用的劳动合同无须采用书面形式（但建议采用书面形式）。固定期限合同及某些特殊安排须采用书面形式。",
  "Employment contract is the legal base of the employment relationship. The law recognises fixed-term and indefinite contracts.": "劳动合同是劳动关系的法律基础。法律承认固定期限合同和无固定期限合同。",
  "Employment contract itself can be written, oral or implied. But if the written contract does not contain all required items, employer must give a written notice of employment.": "劳动合同本身可为书面、口头或默示形式。但如书面合同未包含所有必要事项，雇主须提供书面雇用通知。",
  "Employment contract may be concluded in writing, orally, or by implied conduct. Written form is only required by law for specific contract types (apprenticeship, agency work).": "劳动合同可以书面、口头或默示行为方式订立。仅特定合同类型（学徒合同、劳务派遣合同）依法须采用书面形式。",
  "Employment contract may be verbal or written unless a law requires writing for that item.": "劳动合同可为口头或书面形式，除非法律对特定事项要求书面形式。",
  "Employment contract may exist, but employer must clearly show key working conditions when entering the labour contract. Many key items must be given in writing or permitted electronic form.": "劳动合同可以存在，但雇主在订立劳动合同时须明确告知关键工作条件。许多关键事项须以书面或经许可的电子形式提供。",
  "Employment contract must be concluded in writing, signed by both parties.": "劳动合同须以书面形式订立，由双方签署。",
  "Employment contract must be concluded in writing.": "劳动合同须以书面形式订立。",
  "Employment contract must be concluded in writing. Employer must keep one copy.": "劳动合同须以书面形式订立。雇主须保存一份副本。",
  "Employment contract must be in writing. If concluded verbally, employer must confirm its conditions in writing no later than 1 working day before the employee starts work.": "劳动合同须为书面形式。如以口头方式订立，雇主须于员工开始工作前不迟于1个工作日以书面形式确认合同条件。",
  "Employment contract should include parties, job/position, start date, place of work, pay, working hours, leave, rights and obligations, probation if agreed, and other required conditions.": "劳动合同应包含：当事方、职务/职位、入职日期、工作地点、薪酬、工作时间、假期、权利义务、试用期（如约定）及其他必要条件。",
  "Employment contracts are processed through MOHRE's Tasheel system or the ADDC portal for Abu Dhabi. The e-contract must be registered before the work permit is issued.": "劳动合同通过人力资源和酋长国化部的Tasheel系统或阿布扎比ADDC门户办理。电子合同须在签发工作许可证前完成登记。",
  "Employment contracts must be reported to ZUS (Social Insurance Institution) within 7 days of the employment start date.": "劳动合同须于入职日期后7天内向ZUS（社会保险机构）申报。",
  "Employment rules include law, collective agreements and works agreements. Contract can usually improve employee rights, not weaken mandatory rules.": "雇用规则包括法律、集体协议和企业协议。合同通常可改善员工权利，但不得削弱强制性规定。",
  "Employment terms cannot be below Labour Act and applicable rules/standards.": "劳动条款不得低于《劳动法》及适用规定/标准。",
  "Employment terms cannot be lower than Myanmar labour law minimum rights.": "劳动条款不得低于缅甸劳动法规定的最低权利。",
  "Employment terms cannot go below the Industrial and Commercial Employment (Standing Orders) Ordinance 1968, provincial employment acts, or wage rules.": "劳动条款不得低于1968年《工商业雇佣（常规令）条例》、省级劳动法或工资规定。",
  "Employment terms cannot go below the Labour Contract Law, special statutes or collective agreements.": "劳动条款不得低于《劳动合同法》、专项法规或集体协议的规定。",
  "Employment terms must follow the Bangladesh Labour Act and applicable service rules. A weaker appointment letter will not remove statutory rights.": "劳动条款须遵守孟加拉国《劳动法》及适用的服务规则。较低标准的录用通知书不得剥夺法定权利。",
  "English is the de facto working language. No single federal language requirement for employment contracts; bilingual accommodations may apply in some states.": "英语为事实上的工作语言。联邦层面对劳动合同无统一语言要求；部分州可能适用双语安排。",
  "English is the official language. Contracts are typically in English.": "英语为官方语言，合同通常以英语书写。",
  "English is the official legal working language used in the Labour Act.": "英语为《劳动法》使用的官方法定工作语言。",
  "English or French depends on jurisdiction and workplace. For Quebec/federal bilingual contexts, check language rules separately.": "使用英语或法语取决于司法管辖区和工作场所。对于魁北克/联邦双语背景，须另行核查语言规定。",
  "English or Welsh is appropriate depending on workplace. English is standard. No separate official language rule found for private employment.": "根据工作场所情况，可使用英语或威尔士语，英语为标准用语。私人雇佣领域未见独立的官方语言规定。",
  "Essential conditions are work function, pay, and place of employment. Also include working time, start date, contract type, probation if used, leave, notice, and other terms needed under the Labour Code or workplace rules.": "必要条款包括工作职能、薪酬及工作地点，还应包括工时、入职日期、合同类型、试用期（如适用）、休假、通知期，以及《劳动法》或工作场所规章要求的其他条款。",
  "Essential terms must be documented and handed over within the legal deadlines under section 2 NachwG. Key start/pay/time details are time-sensitive.": "必要条款须在《书面证明法》第2条规定的法定期限内书面记录并交付。入职时间、薪酬及工时等关键信息具有时效性。",
  "Essential terms: job type/title, place of work, and start date. Should also include pay, working time, leave, notice, probation if agreed, applicable CBA, and other required items.": "必要条款：职位类型/名称、工作地点及入职日期，还应包括薪酬、工时、休假、通知期、试用期（如经协商）、适用的CBA及其他必要事项。",
  "Establishments with 10 or more employees generally need registration under the OSH Code; employers must maintain prescribed records/returns.": "雇用10名或以上员工的机构通常须依据《职业安全健康法》进行注册；雇主须保存规定的记录/报表。",
  "Establishments with 10+ employees must post/maintain work rules and file them with the Department of Labour Protection and Welfare.": "雇用10名以上员工的机构须张贴/保存工作规则，并向劳动保护与福利厅备案。",
  "Estonia is very clear: use a written/digital contract and include the statutory list of working conditions.": "爱沙尼亚规定十分明确：须使用书面/电子合同，并载明法定工作条件清单。",
  "Estonian is safest. Digital signing is accepted in practice. Bilingual can help foreign employees understand.": "使用爱沙尼亚语最为稳妥。实践中接受电子签名。双语版本有助于外籍员工理解。",
  "Even though verbal contracts can exist, use written Portuguese paperwork and make sure payroll/labour records match the contract.": "尽管口头合同可以存在，仍应使用葡萄牙语书面文件，并确保薪资/劳动记录与合同一致。",
  "Every employee has the right to a written statement of employment particulars. Since 6 April 2020, this applies from day 1 and also covers workers (not just employees).": "每位员工均有权获得书面雇佣详情声明。自2020年4月6日起，该规定自第一天起适用，且同样适用于工人（不仅限于雇员）。",
  "Every employee must have a written employment agreement.": "每位员工须签订书面劳动协议。",
  "Every new employee must receive the Fair Work Information Statement before, or as soon as possible after, they start. Casuals also get CEIS; fixed-term employees get FTCIS when entering a fixed-term contract.": "每位新员工须在入职前或入职后尽快收到《公平工作信息声明》。临时工还须收到CEIS；固定期限员工在签订固定期限合同时须收到FTCIS。",
  "Federal Labour Law minimum rights cannot be reduced by contract.": "联邦《劳动法》规定的最低权利不得通过合同予以削减。",
  "Federal and state labour laws, including FLSA, FMLA, ADA and state wage/hour laws, set minimum rights. Contract cannot reduce them.": "联邦及州劳动法，包括FLSA、FMLA、ADA及各州工资/工时法，规定了最低权利标准，合同不得予以削减。",
  "Federal employer must provide the written employment statement within the first 30 days of employment, and update it within 30 days after changes.": "联邦雇主须在雇佣开始后30天内提供书面雇佣声明，并在变更后30天内予以更新。",
  "Federal statement must include prescribed employment information under the Canada Labour Standards Regulations, such as employer/employee details, job title, pay, hours, work location, leave and notice-related information.": "联邦声明须包含《加拿大劳动标准条例》规定的雇佣信息，如雇主/雇员详情、职位名称、薪酬、工时、工作地点、休假及通知期相关信息。",
  "Filipino/English are both official. Employment contracts are commonly in English or bilingual.": "菲律宾语/英语均为官方语言。劳动合同通常以英语或双语书写。",
  "Fixed or indefinite contracts are both allowed. Fixed-term must state the duration.": "固定期限合同和无固定期限合同均被允许。固定期限合同须注明期限。",
  "Fixed-duration contract must be written, have a precise end date, and cannot exceed 2 years including renewals. Otherwise it may become undetermined duration.": "固定期限合同须以书面形式订立，载明确切终止日期，含续签在内不得超过2年，否则可能转变为无固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term allowed. Must state the duration or end event. Repeated fixed-term in the same role is limited to 2 years and maximum 3 consecutive contracts.": "允许签订固定期限合同，须注明期限或终止事件。同一岗位反复签订固定期限合同不得超过2年，且最多连续签订3份合同。",
  "Fixed-term contract is allowed only for a justifiable reason when made on the employer's initiative. The reason should be stated.": "由雇主主动提出签订固定期限合同时，须有正当理由，且应在合同中载明。",
  "Fixed-term contract is allowed only for specific temporary needs such as replacement, peak demand, temporary work, or new products. Max 1 year except for specific cases. Can be extended once without losing character.": "固定期限合同仅适用于特定临时需求，如替代、旺季需求、临时性工作或新产品。除特定情形外，期限最长为1年。可续签一次且不改变合同性质。",
  "Fixed-term contract must follow Labour Code limits; repeated fixed-term use is restricted unless an exception applies.": "固定期限合同须遵守《劳动法》的限制规定；除非适用例外情形，否则不得反复使用固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term contract must state parties, activity, work location, remuneration, start date, duration and termination date or event, and reason for fixed-term.": "固定期限合同须载明当事方、工作内容、工作地点、薪酬、入职日期、期限及终止日期或事件，以及签订固定期限合同的原因。",
  "Fixed-term contract must state the term. Reason/need must be stated in cases such as contracts exceeding 12 months.": "固定期限合同须注明期限。超过12个月等情形下，须说明原因/需求。",
  "Fixed-term contract should state the term clearly. Check the Employment and Skills Development Law for limits on duration and renewal.": "固定期限合同应明确载明期限。请查阅《就业与技能发展法》关于期限及续签限制的规定。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are allowed for justified temporary reasons. Term must be stated clearly.": "固定期限合同可在有正当临时原因的情况下使用，期限须明确载明。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are allowed only for specific categories of work (seasonal, specific work, temporarily replacing a regular worker, etc). Misuse converts to indefinite.": "固定期限合同仅适用于特定类别的工作（季节性、特定工作、临时替代正式员工等）。滥用将转变为无固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are allowed only in Labour Code cases and should state term/reason clearly.": "固定期限合同仅适用于《劳动法》规定的情形，应明确载明期限/原因。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are allowed. The contract should clearly state the term/end date and renewal/termination handling.": "允许签订固定期限合同，合同应明确载明期限/终止日期及续签/终止处理方式。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are exceptional and allowed only for listed reasons. Maximum is generally 36 months.": "固定期限合同属于例外情形，仅限于列明的原因方可使用，期限一般不超过36个月。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are exceptional and must be in writing with a clear end date and legal reason.": "固定期限合同属于例外情形，须以书面形式订立，载明明确的终止日期和法定原因。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are exceptional and need an objective reason such as a deadline, specific job or event.": "固定期限合同属于例外情形，须有客观原因，如截止日期、特定工作或特定事件。",
  "Fixed-term contracts are limited. After 3 fixed-term contracts or 33 months total (whichever is first), the next contract must be indefinite.": "固定期限合同受到限制。签订3份固定期限合同或累计达33个月后（以先到者为准），下一份合同须为无固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term contracts cannot include probation. If they do, the probation clause is null and void.": "固定期限合同不得包含试用期条款，如有，该条款无效。",
  "Fixed-term contracts convert to indefinite after 3 years or 3 contracts, whichever comes first.": "固定期限合同在满3年或签订3份合同后（以先到者为准）转变为无固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term contracts end automatically at the agreed date. If renewed multiple times or employment continues after expiry, can convert to indefinite.": "固定期限合同在约定日期自动终止。如多次续签或期满后继续雇佣，可转变为无固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term contracts for Saudi nationals renew automatically if both parties continue after expiry without signing a new contract. For non-Saudi, work permit duration typically aligns with the contract.": "沙特公民的固定期限合同，如双方在期满后未签订新合同而继续履行，则自动续签。对于非沙特员工，工作许可期限通常与合同期限一致。",
  "Fixed-term contracts generally cannot exceed 3 years, or 5 years for certain specialists or workers aged 60+.": "固定期限合同一般不得超过3年，特定专业人员或60岁以上员工不得超过5年。",
  "Fixed-term contracts have special rules. New fixed-term employees must receive the Fixed Term Contract Information Statement.": "固定期限合同有特别规定。新签固定期限合同的员工须收到《固定期限合同信息声明》。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must be in Indonesian. If bilingual and there is a difference, the Indonesian version prevails.": "固定期限合同须以印度尼西亚语书写。如为双语版本且存在差异，以印度尼西亚语版本为准。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must be registered with the Ministry of Labour within 15 days of signing.": "固定期限合同须在签订后15天内向劳动部登记备案。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must be registered with the labour authority within 15 days of signing.": "固定期限合同须在签订后15天内向劳动主管部门登记备案。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must be sent to the employee at the start of employment. Employer must also send a copy to the competent employment center within 5 business days.": "固定期限合同须在员工入职时送达本人。雇主还须在5个工作日内将副本送交有管辖权的就业中心。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must state the end date or event that ends the contract, and the genuine reason for the fixed term.": "固定期限合同须载明终止日期或导致合同终止的事件，以及签订固定期限合同的真实原因。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must state the end date or event. Be careful about implied renewal or conversion to indefinite.": "固定期限合同须载明终止日期或终止事件，须注意默示续签或转变为无固定期限合同的情形。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must state the parties, job, term/duration, pay, and the lawful reason for the fixed-term. Indefinite employment should record pay, role, and key conditions in writing.": "固定期限合同须载明当事方、职位、期限/时长、薪酬及固定期限的合法原因。无固定期限雇佣应以书面形式记录薪酬、职位及主要条件。",
  "Fixed-term contracts must state the term clearly. Use clear written terms to avoid disputes on conversion to indefinite.": "固定期限合同须明确载明期限，以清晰的书面条款避免因转变为无固定期限合同而产生争议。",
  "Fixed-term contracts require an objective reason. Without objective reason, fixed-term for 1+ years must be written; otherwise may be treated as indefinite.": "固定期限合同须有客观原因。无客观原因时，期限1年以上的固定期限合同须以书面形式订立，否则可能被视为无固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term contracts should be in writing. Use only when the temporary nature of the work justifies it.": "固定期限合同应以书面形式订立，仅在工作的临时性质确有必要时使用。",
  "Fixed-term employment cannot exceed 2 years for any single project. Cannot be renewed to cover permanent work.": "单一项目的固定期限雇佣不得超过2年，不得通过续签转为永久性工作。",
  "Fixed-term employment is allowed for specific grounds (visstidsanställning, vikariat, seasonal, age-related exceptions). Repeated or converted fixed-term may become indefinite.": "固定期限雇佣仅限特定情形（visstidsanställning、vikariat、季节性、年龄相关例外）。反复使用或转换后的固定期限雇佣可能转变为无固定期限雇佣。",
  "Fixed-term employment is allowed only for lawful grounds such as temporary need, substitution, trainee, or work within 4 months. No fixed-term without a ground.": "固定期限雇佣仅限于合法理由，如临时需求、替代、实习或4个月内的工作。无正当理由不得签订固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term employment is allowed under labour codes/rules but must not reduce statutory rights. Check applicable central/state rules and standing orders.": "固定期限雇佣在劳动法规下被允许，但不得削减法定权利，须核查适用的中央/州级规定及常规令。",
  "Fixed-term employment is allowed when justified by an objective reason. Some no-reason fixed terms are allowed only within statutory limits. Fixed-term agreement should be in writing.": "固定期限雇佣在有客观原因时被允许。部分无需说明原因的固定期限合同仅在法定限度内方可使用。固定期限协议应以书面形式订立。",
  "Fixed-term employment is limited to 2 years; after 2 years, the worker is deemed to have an indefinite contract. Subject to exceptions.": "固定期限雇佣期限不得超过2年；满2年后，员工视为持有无固定期限合同，但例外情形除外。",
  "Fixed-term employment is possible, but terms cannot remove Employment Ordinance minimum rights.": "固定期限雇佣可行，但条款不得剥夺《雇佣条例》规定的最低权利。",
  "Fixed-term employment is possible, but the term/end date should be clear in writing.": "固定期限雇佣可行，但期限/终止日期应以书面形式明确载明。",
  "Fixed-term is allowed but should be documented clearly. Ensure renewal does not lead to implied permanent employment status.": "允许固定期限雇佣，但应有明确书面记录，确保续签不导致默示的永久雇佣状态。",
  "Fixed-term is allowed for objective temporary reasons. Must state reason and end date. Cannot be used as a standard arrangement for permanent needs.": "固定期限合同可用于有客观临时原因的情形，须注明原因及终止日期，不得作为满足永久性需求的常规安排。",
  "Fixed-term is allowed only for objective reasons such as temporary increase in work, or replacement. Repeated fixed-term for the same job is restricted. Maximum 24 months without an exception.": "固定期限合同仅适用于客观原因，如工作量临时增加或替代。同一岗位反复使用固定期限合同受到限制，无例外情形时最长不超过24个月。",
  "Fixed-term is allowed only for specific cases stated by law. Contract must be written and registered with the Ministry of Labour within 15 days.": "固定期限合同仅适用于法律规定的特定情形，合同须以书面形式订立，并在15天内向劳动部登记备案。",
  "Fixed-term is allowed. State the term clearly and comply with renewal limits under the Labour Act.": "允许固定期限合同，须明确载明期限并遵守《劳动法》关于续签的限制规定。",
  "Fixed-term is only for temporary/seasonal/completion/new-product type work and cannot be used for permanent jobs. Registration with manpower authority is indicated in the law explanation.": "固定期限合同仅适用于临时性/季节性/项目完工型/新产品类工作，不得用于永久性岗位。法律释义指出须向人力资源主管部门登记备案。",
  "Fixed-term or indefinite contracts are both allowed. Fixed-term must state duration.": "固定期限合同和无固定期限合同均被允许，固定期限合同须注明期限。",
  "Fixed-term or specific-work contracts should be in writing. If not properly documented, they may be treated as indefinite.": "固定期限合同或特定工作合同应以书面形式订立；如未作适当记录，可能被视为无固定期限合同。",
  "Fixed-term requires a lawful cause (temporary production need, replacement, substitution). Without cause, the contract is treated as indefinite. Register with SEPE within 10 days.": "固定期限合同须有合法原因（临时生产需求、替代、代替）。无正当原因时，合同被视为无固定期限合同。须在10天内向SEPE登记备案。",
  "Fixed-term requires a lawful reason. Contract must be written and sent to the employment center within 5 business days.": "固定期限合同须有合法原因，合同须以书面形式订立，并在5个工作日内送交就业中心。",
  "Fixed-term terms must state end date or expected duration. Repeated fixed-term contracts need care to avoid abuse.": "固定期限条款须载明终止日期或预计期限，反复签订固定期限合同须谨慎，以防滥用。",
  "Fixed-term terms should be clear in writing. Check federal/provincial rules before using fixed-term repeatedly.": "固定期限条款应以书面形式明确载明。反复使用固定期限合同前，须核查联邦/省级相关规定。",
  "Fixed-term work agreement registration/notification to manpower authority should be checked and completed under current implementing rules.": "固定期限劳动协议向人力资源主管部门的登记/报备，应按现行实施细则核查并完成。",
  "Fixed-term, open-ended and task-based contracts are allowed. Open-ended contract can become mandatory in specific situations, such as qualifying long service or repeated contracts.": "固定期限合同、无固定期限合同及项目制合同均被允许。在特定情形下，如达到长期服务资格或反复签订合同，无固定期限合同可成为强制要求。",
  "Fixed-term, part-time, and telework contracts must be in writing. Indefinite full-time contracts can be verbal, but written is recommended.": "固定期限合同、非全日制合同及远程工作合同须以书面形式订立。无固定期限全职合同可以口头形式订立，但建议以书面形式订立。",
  "Fixed-term/specific-term employment is used in practice. Use clear written terms and avoid using fixed-term to circumvent permanent-employment rights.": "实践中使用固定期限/特定期限雇佣。应使用清晰的书面条款，避免利用固定期限合同规避永久雇佣权利。",
  "For Cyprus, do not only look at the contract. Check the sector CBA and whether the employee is local, EU, or third-country national.": "对于塞浦路斯，不应仅查看合同，还须核查行业CBA，以及员工是本地人、欧盟公民还是第三国国民。",
  "For Egypt, the safest rule is: write the contract clearly. If duration is missing, expect indefinite-employment treatment.": "对于埃及，最稳妥的原则是：明确书写合同内容。如缺少期限条款，将按无固定期限雇佣处理。",
  "For Indonesia, the big trap is fixed-term contracts: they must be written in Indonesian and cannot include probation.": "对于印度尼西亚，最大的陷阱在于固定期限合同：合同须以印度尼西亚语书写，且不得包含试用期条款。",
  "For Kuwait, do not rely on an English-only internal template. Prepare Arabic / bilingual wording and make sure wage, job, term, probation, leave, and end-of-service terms follow the labour law.": "对于科威特，不应仅依赖英语内部模板，须准备阿拉伯语/双语版本，并确保工资、职位、期限、试用期、休假及离职补偿条款符合劳动法规定。",
  "For federally regulated employers, a written employment statement is required. Provincial/territorial rules may differ for other employers.": "对于受联邦监管的雇主，须提供书面雇佣声明。其他雇主适用的省/地区规定可能有所不同。",
  "For foreign employees, written contract is part of the employment/permit process. For local hires, provide written terms at hiring or as soon as possible.": "对于外籍员工，书面合同是雇佣/许可程序的组成部分。对于本地员工，应在入职时或尽快提供书面条款。",
  "For foreign workers, employment contract is tied to LMRA work permit/employment process. Check LMRA requirements before hiring.": "对于外籍劳工，劳动合同与LMRA工作许可/雇佣程序挂钩，招聘前须核查LMRA要求。",
  "For written contracts: parties, role, pay, working time, workplace, leave, notice and policies. For CDD: precise reason, term or minimum duration, role, pay, trial period if any, CBA and applicable protection schemes.": "书面合同须包含：当事方、职位、薪酬、工作时间、工作地点、假期、通知期及相关政策。固定期限合同（CDD）还须注明：确切原因、期限或最短期限、职位、薪酬、试用期（如有）、CBA及适用保护方案。",
  "Foreign worker arrangements and specific employment categories may need additional permits or registrations. Normal employer registration and tax/social security duties apply.": "外籍员工安排及特定雇佣类别可能需要额外许可或登记。正常的雇主注册及税务/社会保险义务同样适用。",
  "Foreign-worker employment may require labour/migration approval and official written contract documentation.": "雇用外籍员工可能需要劳工/移民审批及官方书面合同文件。",
  "Full contract does not have to be in one document, but written employment terms are required.": "完整合同无需集中于一份文件，但必须以书面形式记录雇佣条款。",
  "General law does not give a simple fixed list for every normal contract. In practice: parties, role, start date, workplace, pay, hours, leave, notice and any CBA/statutory terms. Fixed-term end date must be written.": "一般法律并未为每份普通合同规定简单固定的清单。实践中应包含：当事方、职位、入职日期、工作地点、薪酬、工时、假期、通知期及任何CBA/法定条款。固定期限合同的终止日期必须以书面注明。",
  "German is the safest working language for local compliance. No general English-only permission was found in the cited official law.": "就本地合规而言，德语是最安全的工作语言。所引用的官方法律中未发现允许仅使用英语的一般性规定。",
  "Give the written statement even if work already started. Ghana's key rule is simple: main employment terms must be put in writing within 2 months.": "即使员工已开始工作，也应提供书面声明。加纳的核心规则很简单：主要雇佣条款必须在2个月内以书面形式确立。",
  "Greece is paperwork-heavy. Give written terms quickly and keep ERGANI declarations aligned with the contract.": "希腊的文书工作繁多。应尽快提供书面条款，并确保ERGANI申报与合同保持一致。",
  "Greek is safest for local compliance. Official English guidance confirms the written-information duty but does not create an English-only rule.": "就本地合规而言，希腊语是最安全的选择。官方英语指引确认了书面告知义务，但并未规定仅可使用英语。",
  "Greek is safest for local use; English/bilingual contracts are common for foreign workers, but local law/authorities rely on official languages.": "希腊语最适合本地使用；英语/双语合同在外籍员工中较为常见，但本地法律/当局依赖官方语言。",
  "Hebrew is the practical working language for local employment. For employees who do not understand Hebrew, bilingual wording is safest.": "希伯来语是本地雇佣的实用工作语言。对于不懂希伯来语的员工，双语表述最为稳妥。",
  "Hong Kong does not force every employment contract to be written, but written terms are strongly safer. Make sure pay, notice and end-of-year payment are clear.": "香港并非强制要求所有雇佣合同均须以书面形式订立，但书面条款安全性更高。须确保薪酬、通知期及年终款项清晰明确。",
  "If a trial period is agreed, its duration and conditions must be written in the notice/contract.": "如约定试用期，其期限和条件必须在通知/合同中以书面注明。",
  "If a written contract is used, include parties, job/position, start date, pay, term if fixed, benefits, confidentiality/IP/non-compete if applicable, termination/at-will statement, and governing law/jurisdiction.": "如使用书面合同，应包含：当事方、职位/岗位、入职日期、薪酬、期限（如为固定期限）、福利、保密/IP/竞业限制条款（如适用）、终止/随意雇佣声明及适用法律/管辖权。",
  "If agreed, probation cannot exceed 6 months. For fixed-term work, probation must be proportionate and cannot exceed 1/4 of the contract duration or 6 months.": "如有约定，试用期不得超过6个月。对于固定期限工作，试用期须与合同期限相称，且不得超过合同期限的1/4或6个月。",
  "If fixed-term, must state the expected duration or the fixed-term end date or event.": "如为固定期限合同，必须注明预计期限、固定终止日期或终止事件。",
  "If fixed-term, the end date must be stated in the notice/contract.": "如为固定期限合同，终止日期必须在通知/合同中注明。",
  "If fixed-term, the end date or event must be clearly stated. BCEA and Labour Relations Act rules on fixed-term apply to workers earning below the threshold.": "如为固定期限合同，终止日期或终止事件必须明确注明。《基本就业条件法》（BCEA）及《劳动关系法》关于固定期限合同的规定适用于收入低于门槛的员工。",
  "If law, contract, work rules, works council agreement or collective agreement differ, the more favourable right for the worker generally applies.": "如法律、合同、工作规则、职工委员会协议或集体协议之间存在差异，通常适用对员工更为有利的权利。",
  "If probation is used, it should be stated clearly in the KETs. It cannot reduce Employment Act minimum rights.": "如使用试用期，应在关键雇佣条款（KETs）中明确注明。试用期不得降低《雇佣法》规定的最低权利。",
  "If probation is used, put it clearly in writing. Kenya defines a probationary contract as written and not more than 12 months.": "如使用试用期，须以书面形式明确注明。肯尼亚将试用合同定义为书面形式且不超过12个月。",
  "If the contract is not written or does not state its duration, it is treated as indefinite.": "如合同未以书面订立或未注明期限，则视为无固定期限合同。",
  "If verbal, parties must at least agree on type of work, work location, pay amount/form and payment periods. Written contracts usually record parties, role, workplace, pay, term and agreed conditions.": "如为口头合同，双方至少须就工作类型、工作地点、薪酬金额/形式及支付周期达成一致。书面合同通常记录当事方、职位、工作地点、薪酬、期限及约定条件。",
  "If work starts before signing, the written contract must be signed within 1 month from the first working day.": "如员工在签署合同前开始工作，书面合同必须在第一个工作日起1个月内签署。",
  "In Denmark, the contract is mainly about transparency. It tells the employee the key terms and points to the CBA if one applies.": "在丹麦，合同主要注重透明度。合同向员工告知关键条款，并在适用时指明相关CBA。",
  "In Lithuania, the two practical must-dos are simple: sign the employment contract in writing, then notify Sodra before the person starts work.": "在立陶宛，两项实际必做事项很简单：以书面形式签署雇佣合同，然后在员工开始工作前通知Sodra。",
  "Include parties, job, workplace, start date, pay and expenses, working time, probation if agreed, notice, leave, and applicable CBA reference.": "应包含：当事方、职位、工作地点、入职日期、薪酬及费用、工作时间、试用期（如有约定）、通知期、假期及适用的CBA参考。",
  "Indefinite contracts start with a 6-month probation period by law. CBA may extend to 8 months for companies with 6-100 workers, or 1 year for companies with up to 5 workers.": "无固定期限合同依法以6个月试用期开始。CBA可将6至100名员工的公司试用期延长至8个月，或将最多5名员工的公司试用期延长至1年。",
  "Indefinite employment contracts may be oral. Fixed-term, internship, training, and temporary contracts must be in writing. Any party may demand that the contract be in writing.": "无固定期限雇佣合同可以是口头的。固定期限、实习、培训及临时合同必须以书面形式订立。任何一方均可要求将合同以书面形式订立。",
  "Indefinite employment is the default. Fixed-term is allowed only when justified by the nature of the work.": "无固定期限雇佣为默认形式。固定期限雇佣仅在工作性质有合理依据时方可采用。",
  "India is state-sensitive. Use the appointment letter as the basic written proof, then check the state Shops and Establishments law and applicable rules.": "印度受各邦法律影响较大。以任命书作为基本书面证明，然后查阅各邦的商店与企业法及适用规定。",
  "Individual employment agreement in writing is strongly indicated under the Employment and Skills Development Law and associated rules.": "根据《就业与技能发展法》及相关规定，强烈建议以书面形式订立个人雇佣协议。",
  "Individual employment contract may be tacit or express, verbal or written. Written contract is still best for proof and payroll setup.": "个人雇佣合同可以是默示或明示的，口头或书面的。书面合同仍是证明和薪资设置的最佳方式。",
  "Individual employment contract should be written in 2 copies. If not written, employer bears any legal doubt.": "个人雇佣合同应一式两份以书面形式订立。如未以书面订立，雇主须承担任何法律疑问的风险。",
  "Initial period can be agreed for new hires for a maximum of 30 days, or up to 180 days for directors, managers or employees with high specialization. State clearly in writing.": "新员工可约定最长30天的初始期，董事、管理人员或高度专业化员工可约定最长180天。须以书面形式明确注明。",
  "Issue at appointment. Existing employees without appointment letters must receive one within 3 months from commencement of the Code.": "应在任命时发放。没有任命书的现有员工必须在《法典》生效后3个月内收到任命书。",
  "Italy is paperwork-heavy. Make sure the contract or written document matches the applicable collective agreement and hiring notice.": "意大利的文书工作繁多。须确保合同或书面文件与适用的集体协议及招聘通知相符。",
  "Japan is not just an offer letter. Give written working conditions at hiring and make sure workplace rules match the contract.": "日本的要求不止于录用通知书。须在雇用时提供书面工作条件，并确保工作场所规则与合同一致。",
  "KETs must be given in writing within 14 days after the employee starts work.": "关键雇佣条款（KETs）必须在员工开始工作后14天内以书面形式提供。",
  "KETs must include full name of employer/employee, job title and duties, start date, duration if fixed-term, working arrangements (hours/days/shift), pay including salary/overtime/bonuses/allowances, leave entitlements, medical benefits, notice and probation if applicable.": "关键雇佣条款（KETs）必须包含：雇主/员工全名、职位及职责、入职日期、期限（如为固定期限）、工作安排（工时/工作日/轮班）、薪酬（含基本工资/加班费/奖金/津贴）、假期权利、医疗福利、通知期及试用期（如适用）。",
  "Key conditions (employer/employee details, start date, job title/duties, workplace, hours, salary/pay period, vacation, CBA reference, notice) must be given no later than 7 days from the first working day. Other conditions within 1 month.": "关键条款（雇主/员工信息、入职日期、职位/职责、工作地点、工时、薪酬/支付周期、假期、CBA参考、通知期）必须在第一个工作日起不迟于7天内提供。其他条款须在1个月内提供。",
  "Key terms should include wages, position, working hours, leave, notice, overtime, benefits, contract type, and employer obligations under the Employment Act 1955.": "关键条款应包含：工资、职位、工作时间、假期、通知期、加班、福利、合同类型及雇主根据《1955年雇佣法》承担的义务。",
  "Khmer is safest because local labour administration and courts use Khmer. Bilingual is practical for foreign employers.": "高棉语最为安全，因为当地劳工行政机构和法院均使用高棉语。双语文本对外国雇主而言较为实用。",
  "Korean is safest. Official documents and enforcement are in Korean. Bilingual is used for international hires.": "韩语最为安全。官方文件和执法均使用韩语。双语文本适用于国际招聘。",
  "Labour Act minimum rights cannot be reduced by contract.": "《劳动法》规定的最低权利不得通过合同予以削减。",
  "Labour Act recognises different contract types. State clearly whether the contract is permanent, fixed-term, casual, temporary or for a specific task.": "《劳动法》承认不同合同类型。须明确注明合同是永久性、固定期限、临时性、短期性还是针对特定任务的。",
  "Labour Code and applicable DOLE issuances set minimum rights. Contract cannot go below them.": "《劳动法典》及劳动就业部（DOLE）相关规定设定了最低权利。合同不得低于该标准。",
  "Labour Code and applicable collective agreement override weaker contract terms.": "《劳动法典》及适用的集体协议优先于较弱的合同条款。",
  "Labour Code and collective agreements override weaker contract wording.": "《劳动法典》及集体协议优先于较弱的合同表述。",
  "Labour Code and collective agreements set minimum rights. Contract cannot go below them.": "《劳动法典》及集体协议设定最低权利。合同不得低于该标准。",
  "Labour Code minimum rights and applicable collective agreements cannot be bypassed by contract.": "《劳动法典》规定的最低权利及适用的集体协议不得通过合同规避。",
  "Labour Code minimum rights and applicable collective agreements cannot be reduced by contract.": "《劳动法典》规定的最低权利及适用的集体协议不得通过合同予以削减。",
  "Labour Code minimum rights and applicable collective agreements cannot be reduced.": "《劳动法典》规定的最低权利及适用的集体协议不得被削减。",
  "Labour Code minimum rights apply. Contract cannot reduce them.": "《劳动法典》规定的最低权利适用。合同不得予以削减。",
  "Labour Code minimum rights apply. Internal labour regulations and CBAs may set additional conditions.": "《劳动法典》规定的最低权利适用。内部劳动规章及CBA可设定额外条件。",
  "Labour Code minimum rights cannot be reduced by contract. CBAs may set additional standards.": "《劳动法典》规定的最低权利不得通过合同予以削减。CBA可设定额外标准。",
  "Labour Code minimums apply. Collective contracts/conventions have separate written and filing rules.": "《劳动法典》最低标准适用。集体合同/协议有各自的书面及备案规则。",
  "Labour Law No. 4857 minimum rights and applicable collective agreements set the floor.": "第4857号《劳动法》规定的最低权利及适用的集体协议构成最低底线。",
  "Labour Law minimum rights apply regardless of contract. Any weaker term is void.": "《劳动法》规定的最低权利不论合同内容如何均适用。任何较弱的条款均属无效。",
  "Labour Law minimum rights apply. Internal rules and CBAs may add requirements.": "《劳动法》规定的最低权利适用。内部规章及CBA可增加额外要求。",
  "Labour Law minimum rights cannot be reduced. Collective agreements may add stronger terms.": "《劳动法》规定的最低权利不得被削减。集体协议可增加更为有利的条款。",
  "Labour Law minimum rights cannot be reduced. If no contract is provided, the law protects the employee.": "《劳动法》规定的最低权利不得被削减。如未提供合同，法律保护员工权益。",
  "Labour Law minimum rights cannot be waived. Collective contracts can override weaker individual contract terms.": "《劳动法》规定的最低权利不得放弃。集体合同可优先于较弱的个人合同条款。",
  "Labour Protection Act minimum rights cannot be reduced. Applicable CBA and work rules add additional terms.": "《劳动保护法》规定的最低权利不得被削减。适用的CBA及工作规则增加额外条款。",
  "Labour Standards Act minimum rights apply. Contract cannot go below them.": "《劳动标准法》规定的最低权利适用。合同不得低于该标准。",
  "Labour Standards Act minimum rights apply. Contract, work rules, and collective agreements all form the minimum floor.": "《劳动标准法》规定的最低权利适用。合同、工作规则及集体协议共同构成最低底线。",
  "Labour Standards Act sets minimum standards. Rules of employment and collective agreements can also affect contract terms.": "《劳动标准法》设定最低标准。就业规则及集体协议亦可影响合同条款。",
  "Labour contract can be written or verbal. Fixed-duration contract must be written and must have a precise end date.": "劳动合同可以是书面或口头的。固定期限合同必须以书面形式订立，并须注明明确的终止日期。",
  "Labour law and applicable collective agreements set minimum rights. Contract cannot go below them.": "劳动法及适用的集体协议设定最低权利。合同不得低于该标准。",
  "Labour law minimum rights and applicable collective agreements cannot be reduced.": "劳动法规定的最低权利及适用的集体协议不得被削减。",
  "Labour law minimum rights cannot be reduced by contract. Profit-sharing, CTS and other statutory benefits are mandatory.": "劳动法规定的最低权利不得通过合同予以削减。利润分享、CTS及其他法定福利为强制性规定。",
  "Labour law minimums apply even if contract says less. Collective agreements can set working conditions during their term.": "即使合同规定的标准更低，劳动法最低标准仍适用。集体协议可在其有效期内设定工作条件。",
  "Labour units and employees must participate in social insurance. Foreign labour involves work permit / labour administration obligations.": "用人单位和员工必须参加社会保险。外籍劳工涉及工作许可/劳动行政义务。",
  "Law, applicable CBA, and minimum wage rules override weaker contract terms.": "法律、适用的CBA及最低工资规定优先于较弱的合同条款。",
  "Law, collective agreements and works agreements can set the minimum scope of rights even if the contract is silent.": "即使合同未作规定，法律、集体协议及企业协议可设定权利的最低范围。",
  "Limited-term contract ends when its term expires. If both parties keep performing after expiry, it is treated as renewed as unlimited-term from the beginning.": "有期限合同在期限届满时终止。如双方在期限届满后继续履行，则视为从一开始即续签为无固定期限合同。",
  "Limited/unlimited contracts are recognized. Fixed-term terms should be written clearly, especially end date and renewal handling.": "有期限/无期限合同均受认可。固定期限条款应以书面形式明确注明，尤其是终止日期和续签处理方式。",
  "Luxembourg is a small-country jurisdiction with a mix of French/German legal tradition. Always check the applicable collective agreement in addition to the Labour Code.": "卢森堡是融合了法语/德语法律传统的小国司法管辖区。除《劳动法典》外，务必查阅适用的集体协议。",
  "MOHRE-approved contract covers: parties, job/profession, workplace, start date, duration (1-year or 2-year), salary, probation, working hours, leave, notice, end-of-service gratuity and termination terms.": "劳工和人力资源部（MOHRE）批准的合同涵盖：当事方、职位/职业、工作地点、入职日期、期限（1年或2年）、薪酬、试用期、工作时间、假期、通知期、离职酬劳及终止条款。",
  "Main items within 7 days from start; remaining items within 1 month from start.": "主要条款须在入职后7天内提供；其余条款须在入职后1个月内提供。",
  "Malaysia has two main employee categories: those covered by the Employment Act and those not. Check coverage before drafting.": "马来西亚有两类主要员工类别：受《雇佣法》保障的员工和不受保障的员工。起草合同前须确认适用范围。",
  "Malta requires a written conditions statement within 8 calendar days. State probation if used because it affects termination rules.": "马耳他要求在8个自然日内提供书面条款声明。如使用试用期，须明确注明，因为这将影响终止规则。",
  "Mandarin Chinese (Traditional) is safest for local compliance. Bilingual contracts are used in international companies.": "繁体中文最适合本地合规。国际公司通常使用双语合同。",
  "Mandatory written information: employer/employee identity, start date, workplace, job title/duties, hours and overtime, pay and pay period, vacation, applicable CBA, and notice provisions.": "强制书面信息包括：雇主/员工身份信息、入职日期、工作地点、职位/职责、工时及加班、薪酬及支付周期、假期、适用的CBA及通知期规定。",
  "Mexico is employee-protective. Written contract, IMSS registration, and correct contract type all matter. Do not delay either.": "墨西哥对员工保护力度较强。书面合同、社会保险局（IMSS）登记及正确的合同类型均至关重要。两者均不得延误。",
  "Minimum Employment Standards and applicable awards/collective agreements cannot be reduced by the employment agreement.": "最低就业标准及适用的奖励/集体协议不得通过雇佣协议予以削减。",
  "Minimum confirmed from official Act: appointment letter and photo ID card are required. Practical appointment letter should include parties, designation, joining date, wage, work type, working hours, leave, probation and termination terms, aligned with Labour Act/Rules.": "官方法律确认的最低要求：须提供任命书和附照片的身份证件。实用的任命书应包含：当事方、职务、入职日期、工资、工作类型、工作时间、假期、试用期及终止条款，并与《劳动法》/规定保持一致。",
  "Minimum contract items: employee base wage and job title. Also include parties, start date, workplace, working time, probation if any, and any fixed-term/telework terms.": "合同最低条款：员工基本工资及职位。还应包含：当事方、入职日期、工作地点、工作时间、试用期（如有）及任何固定期限/远程工作条款。",
  "Morocco has strict fixed-term limits. If the nature of the work is permanent, use an indefinite contract.": "摩洛哥对固定期限合同有严格限制。如工作性质为永久性的，应使用无固定期限合同。",
  "Most US employment is indefinite/at-will. Fixed-term contracts are exceptional and should be clearly written with specific end terms.": "美国大多数雇佣为无固定期限/随意雇佣。固定期限合同属例外情况，应以书面形式明确注明具体终止条款。",
  "Most employment contracts are indefinite and do not require a specific written form. Fixed-term contracts must be in writing.": "大多数劳动合同为无固定期限合同，无需特定书面形式。固定期限合同必须以书面形式订立。",
  "Must be agreed before the employee starts work.": "必须在员工开始工作前达成一致。",
  "Must be agreed in writing. Probation duration limits depend on worker category (e.g., 90 days for ordinary, 120 days for supervisory, up to 30 days for workers with disability).": "必须以书面形式达成一致。试用期限制取决于员工类别（例如，普通员工90天，管理人员120天，残障人士最多30天）。",
  "Must clearly cover wages/rate, wage period, notice period and end-of-year payment if applicable. Recommended: role, workplace, hours, overtime, holidays, leave and termination terms.": "必须明确涵盖工资/薪酬标准、工资周期、通知期及年终付款（如适用）。建议包含：职位、工作地点、工时、加班、假期、休假及终止条款。",
  "Must clearly indicate wages, working hours and other prescribed working conditions. Practical written terms include contract term, workplace/job duties, hours/rest/days off/leave, wage calculation/payment, resignation and dismissal grounds.": "必须明确注明工资、工作时间及其他规定的工作条件。实用书面条款包括：合同期限、工作地点/工作职责、工时/休息/休假/休假天数、工资计算/支付方式、辞职及解雇理由。",
  "Must clearly specify wages, hours of employment, holiday, annual paid leave and other matters as set by ministerial ordinance, including job duties, workplace, and working-period if fixed-term.": "必须明确规定工资、工作时间、假期、年假及劳动省令规定的其他事项，包括工作职责、工作地点及合同期限（如为固定期限合同）。",
  "Must describe the main employment terms: employer/employee details, workplace, job, start date, duration if temporary, pay, hours, leave, notice and applicable CBA if any.": "必须描述主要雇佣条款：雇主/员工详情、工作地点、职位、入职日期、期限（如为临时合同）、薪酬、工时、休假、通知期及适用的CBA（如有）。",
  "Must include employer details, employee details, contract term, job content and location, working hours/rest/leave, pay, social insurance, labour protection, working conditions and occupational safety.": "必须包含雇主信息、员工信息、合同期限、工作内容及地点、工时/休息/休假、薪酬、社会保险、劳动保护、工作条件及职业安全。",
  "Must include employer name/business, worker name/address/nationality/qualification, type of work, workplace, pay, date of employment, contract term if fixed, leave, notice and end-of-service gratuity terms.": "必须包含雇主名称/单位、员工姓名/地址/国籍/资质、工作类型、工作地点、薪酬、入职日期、合同期限（如为固定期限）、休假、通知期及离职酬金条款。",
  "Must include employer/employee contact details, agreed hours (or specified reasonable hours), nature of work, place(s) of work, and mandatory trial-period/right-to-representation clauses if applicable.": "必须包含雇主/员工联系方式、约定工时（或指定的合理工时）、工作性质、工作地点，以及强制性试用期/代表权条款（如适用）。",
  "Must include employer/employee details, contract/start date, duties, title if legally relevant, pay and pay date, taxes/withholdings, benefits, working time, workplace, holiday, notice terms, work rules and CBA reference if applicable.": "必须包含雇主/员工详情、合同/入职日期、职责、职称（如具有法律相关性）、薪酬及发薪日期、税款/代扣款、福利、工作时间、工作地点、假期、通知条款、工作规则及CBA参考（如适用）。",
  "Must include employer/employee details, job type, workplace, wages, working hours, leave, benefits, duration if fixed, probation if used, end-of-agreement terms, and other agreed conditions.": "必须包含雇主/员工详情、工作类型、工作地点、工资、工作时间、休假、福利、合同期限（如为固定期限）、试用期（如适用）、合同终止条款及其他约定条件。",
  "Must include employer/employee details, job type/description, place of work, duration/type of contract, wages and pay method/date, pay grade/scale, working and rest hours, social insurance, training terms, and other agreed conditions.": "必须包含雇主/员工详情、工作类型/描述、工作地点、合同期限/类型、工资及支付方式/日期、薪酬等级/薪级、工作及休息时间、社会保险、培训条款及其他约定条件。",
  "Must include employer/employee details, workplace, job title/description, start date, expected duration or end date if fixed-term, hours and rest, probation if agreed, pay and salary period, vacation, notice, applicable CBA, and pension scheme.": "必须包含雇主/员工详情、工作地点、职称/职位描述、入职日期、预计期限或结束日期（如为固定期限合同）、工时及休息、试用期（如已约定）、薪酬及工资周期、假期、通知期、适用的CBA及养老金计划。",
  "Must include employer/worker details, job type/description, work duration, work schedule, wage amount and form, where and how wage is paid, training/development, other agreed conditions.": "必须包含雇主/员工详情、工作类型/描述、工作期限、工作安排、工资金额及形式、工资支付地点及方式、培训/发展及其他约定条件。",
  "Must include parties and IDs/address, workplace, job title/type/description, signing date and start date, permanent/fixed-term status and fixed-term end/expected duration, annual leave, termination procedure/notice, pay and working time details.": "必须包含当事人及身份证件/地址、工作地点、职称/工作类型/描述、签订日期及入职日期、永久/固定期限状态及固定期限结束/预计期限、年假、终止程序/通知期、薪酬及工时详情。",
  "Must include parties and PIB/JMBG, workplace, job name/description, type of employment, start date, working hours, pay and allowances, vacation, notice, and other required items under the Labour Law.": "必须包含当事人及PIB/JMBG、工作地点、职位名称/描述、雇用类型、入职日期、工作时间、薪酬及津贴、假期、通知期及劳动法规定的其他必要事项。",
  "Must include parties, date of employment, job, place of work, start date, duration if fixed-term, daily/weekly hours, pay and pay date, annual leave, notice, and applicable collective agreement if any.": "必须包含当事人、雇用日期、职位、工作地点、入职日期、合同期限（如为固定期限）、每日/每周工时、薪酬及发薪日期、年假、通知期及适用的集体协议（如有）。",
  "Must include parties, job, workplace, pay, start date, duration if fixed, leave, working hours, and end-of-service gratuity terms.": "必须包含当事人、职位、工作地点、薪酬、入职日期、合同期限（如为固定期限）、休假、工作时间及离职酬金条款。",
  "Must include parties, job, workplace, start date, probation if agreed, pay/salary, working time, leave, and notice. Also reference applicable CBA if one applies.": "必须包含当事人、职位、工作地点、入职日期、试用期（如已约定）、薪酬/工资、工作时间、休假及通知期。如适用，还需引用适用的CBA。",
  "Must include parties, place of work, job title/nature, signing date/start date, contract duration, leave, notice, pay, working day/week length, and other required Labour Code items.": "必须包含当事人、工作地点、职称/工作性质、签订日期/入职日期、合同期限、休假、通知期、薪酬、每工作日/每周工时，以及劳动法典规定的其他必要事项。",
  "Must include party details, ID details, worker residence if moved for work, contract duration/type, working hours, pay amount/form/payment period/place, workplace, agreed terms, place/date and signatures.": "必须包含当事人详情、身份证件信息、员工住所（如因工作迁居）、合同期限/类型、工作时间、薪酬金额/形式/支付周期/支付地点、工作地点、约定条款、签订地点/日期及签名。",
  "Must include place/date, party details, worker start date, job/services and workplace, pay amount/form/payment period, working hours distribution, contract term, agreed benefits and other agreed terms.": "必须包含签订地点/日期、当事人详情、员工入职日期、职位/服务内容及工作地点、薪酬金额/形式/支付周期、工时分配、合同期限、约定福利及其他约定条款。",
  "Must include type of employment contract, contract parties, contract date and start of employment, work position, place of work, remuneration including components, working hours standard, and leave entitlements.": "必须包含劳动合同类型、合同当事人、合同签订日期及入职日期、工作岗位、工作地点、薪酬（含各组成部分）、工作时间标准及休假权利。",
  "Must state job, workplace, start date, contract duration, working hours, salary and payment period, holiday allowance and leave, notice period, applicable CBA, pension scheme, and for variable hours: days/times or reference hours as applicable.": "必须注明职位、工作地点、入职日期、合同期限、工作时间、工资及支付周期、假期津贴及休假、通知期、适用的CBA、养老金计划，以及对于浮动工时：适用的工作日/时间或参考工时。",
  "Must state parties, workplace, start date, fixed/permanent duration, probation if any, grade/level/job title or work description, pay and pay period, paid leave, working time and termination notice.": "必须注明当事人、工作地点、入职日期、固定/永久期限、试用期（如有）、职级/级别/职称或工作描述、薪酬及支付周期、带薪休假、工作时间及终止通知。",
  "Myanmar: always use written agreements. Registration with the township labour office is important for both employer and employee.": "缅甸：务必使用书面协议。向镇区劳工局进行登记对雇主和员工均十分重要。",
  "NES, awards and enterprise agreements override weaker contract terms. Contract terms below minimum entitlements have no effect.": "NES、工资裁决及企业协议凌驾于较弱的合同条款之上。低于最低权利标准的合同条款无效。",
  "NRA notification is mandatory before work starts. Employer gives the employee the signed contract and the certified notification copy.": "工作开始前必须进行NRA通知。雇主向员工提供已签署的合同及经认证的通知副本。",
  "New Zealand insists on a signed written agreement before or at the start of employment. Use it even when the hiring process is informal.": "新西兰要求在入职前或入职时签订书面协议。即使招聘程序非正式，也必须使用书面协议。",
  "Nigeria: give a written statement within 3 months and always document pay, leave, hours and notice.": "尼日利亚：须在3个月内提供书面声明，并始终以书面形式记录薪酬、休假、工时及通知期。",
  "No contract filing stated on this page. Separate employee social security registration rules apply when hiring staff.": "本页未注明合同备案要求。雇用员工时，适用单独的员工社会保险登记规定。",
  "No employment contract filing found in cited sources. Employer must still arrange statutory employment records and insurance details.": "引用来源中未发现劳动合同备案要求。雇主仍须安排法定雇佣记录及保险详情。",
  "No explicit language requirement found in the official Employment Act English version. Malay (Bahasa Malaysia) or English are both common; Malay is safest for local compliance.": "官方《雇佣法》英文版中未发现明确的语言要求。马来语（Bahasa Malaysia）和英语均为常用语言；马来语对于本地合规最为稳妥。",
  "No federal general deadline for written contracts. If a written contract is used, it should be signed before work starts and key offer terms confirmed in writing.": "联邦层面对书面合同无统一截止期限要求。如使用书面合同，应在工作开始前签署，并以书面形式确认主要录用条款。",
  "No filing of the employment contract itself found in cited sources. Employer must handle normal payroll/social security registration duties.": "引用来源中未发现劳动合同本身的备案要求。雇主须履行正常的工资/社会保险登记义务。",
  "No fixed deadline for a non-written contract. If written, copy must be given immediately after signing. Changes to key terms must also be explained clearly.": "非书面合同无固定截止期限。如为书面合同，签署后须立即交付副本。关键条款的变更也必须清晰说明。",
  "No fixed statutory deadline found in the cited official source. Best practice: before work starts or at the start.": "引用的官方来源中未发现固定的法定截止期限。最佳做法：在工作开始前或工作开始时完成。",
  "No general English-contract rule found in official source. Japanese is safest for local enforceability; bilingual contracts are common for foreign employees.": "官方来源中未发现关于英文合同的通用规定。日语对于本地执行力最为稳妥；双语合同对外籍员工较为常见。",
  "No general Labour Department filing for a normal employment contract found. Separate MPF, tax and employee record duties may apply.": "未发现普通劳动合同向劳工处备案的一般要求。MPF、税务及员工记录等方面的义务可能另行适用。",
  "No general contract filing for domestic employers. Employer must comply with national health/pension/employment insurance and payroll/tax registrations.": "国内雇主无需进行一般合同备案。雇主须遵守国家医疗/养老/就业保险及工资/税务登记要求。",
  "No general contract filing found for local employees. Work-permit cases require the signed employment contract with the application.": "本地员工无需进行一般合同备案。申请工作许可时需提交已签署的劳动合同。",
  "No general contract filing found in official guidance. Separate payroll, tax and pension/social registration duties may apply.": "官方指引中未发现一般合同备案要求。工资、税务及养老金/社会保险登记义务可能另行适用。",
  "No general contract filing found in the Labour Code source. Separate tax/social security onboarding may apply.": "劳动法典来源中未发现一般合同备案要求。税务/社会保险入职登记可能另行适用。",
  "No general contract filing found in the cited Labour Code source. Employer must handle normal payroll/social security registrations.": "引用的劳动法典来源中未发现一般合同备案要求。雇主须履行正常的工资/社会保险登记义务。",
  "No general contract filing found in the cited official Labour Law source. Foreign workers need separate work-permit/employment-card compliance.": "引用的官方劳动法来源中未发现一般合同备案要求。外籍员工需单独办理工作许可/就业证合规手续。",
  "No general contract filing found on the cited ETC page. Employer must follow ETC and IRD registration duties.": "引用的ETC页面中未发现一般合同备案要求。雇主须遵守ETC及IRD的登记义务。",
  "No general contract filing found. Employer should keep proof that written terms were given.": "未发现一般合同备案要求。雇主应保留已交付书面条款的证明。",
  "No general contract filing. Employer must comply with CPF, MOM and IRAS registration/reporting duties.": "无需进行一般合同备案。雇主须遵守CPF、MOM及IRAS的登记/申报义务。",
  "No general contract filing. Employer must handle normal payroll tax/social security registration and reporting.": "无需进行一般合同备案。雇主须履行正常的工资税/社会保险登记及申报义务。",
  "No general contract filing. Employer must register with Social Insurance Agency and Health Insurance companies, and declare employment to these agencies before work starts.": "无需进行一般合同备案。雇主须在工作开始前向社会保险机构及医疗保险公司进行注册，并向上述机构申报雇佣情况。",
  "No general deadline for a normal indefinite contract. Employee must be registered from the start of employment.": "普通无固定期限合同无一般截止期限要求。员工须从入职之日起进行登记。",
  "No general deadline for giving a written contract. Employer must provide pay slips monthly and termination notice in writing when ending the contract.": "提供书面合同无一般截止期限要求。雇主须每月提供工资单，并在终止合同时以书面形式发出通知。",
  "No general deadline for oral/indefinite contracts in the cited law. Written contracts should be signed before work starts; fixed-term must be written from the start.": "引用法律中对口头/无固定期限合同无一般截止期限要求。书面合同应在工作开始前签署；固定期限合同从一开始就必须以书面形式订立。",
  "No general deadline for ordinary verbal/written contracts found in the cited articles. Written items should be signed before relying on them.": "引用条文中未发现对普通口头/书面合同的一般截止期限要求。书面条款应在依赖之前完成签署。",
  "No general deadline found in the Labour Protection Act for an ordinary contract. Written fixed-term terms should be signed before work starts.": "《劳动保护法》中未发现对普通合同的一般截止期限要求。固定期限合同的书面条款应在工作开始前签署。",
  "No general deadline found in the cited Labour Code articles for oral contracts. Written fixed-term contracts should be signed before relying on them.": "引用的劳动法典条文中未发现对口头合同的一般截止期限要求。固定期限书面合同应在依赖之前完成签署。",
  "No general federal language requirement found in official source. English is standard.": "官方来源中未发现联邦层面的一般语言要求。英语为标准语言。",
  "No general federal maximum probation period in the cited official pages. Probation must not remove minimum rights.": "引用的官方页面中未发现联邦层面的最长试用期规定。试用期不得剥夺最低权利。",
  "No general federal rule. If used, state clearly. Probation alone does not change at-will status in most states.": "无联邦层面的通用规定。如设置试用期，须明确说明。在大多数州，试用期本身不改变随意雇佣状态。",
  "No general filing of individual employment contract found in the cited articles. Collective conventions must be deposited with labour authority.": "引用条文中未发现个人劳动合同的一般备案要求。集体协议须向劳动主管部门备案。",
  "No general filing of the employment contract found in cited source. Employer should keep the written statement and comply with employment data/social security duties.": "引用来源中未发现劳动合同的一般备案要求。雇主应保存书面声明，并遵守雇佣数据/社会保险义务。",
  "No general government filing of individual employment contract found on the official portal.": "官方门户网站上未发现个人劳动合同的一般政府备案要求。",
  "No general government filing of the employment contract found in official Fair Work sources. Employers must still meet tax, super and record-keeping obligations.": "官方公平工作来源中未发现劳动合同的一般政府备案要求。雇主仍须履行税务、养老金及记录保存义务。",
  "No general individual contract filing confirmed from the cited official law page. Social insurance registration still applies.": "引用的官方法律页面中未确认个人合同的一般备案要求。社会保险登记仍然适用。",
  "No general individual contract filing found for federal employment statement. Employers must keep required employment records.": "联邦雇佣声明中未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。雇主须保存所需的雇佣记录。",
  "No general individual contract filing found for ordinary employment. Employer must handle BPS registration and normal payroll/tax/social security obligations.": "普通雇佣情况下未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。雇主须处理BPS登记及正常的工资/税务/社会保险义务。",
  "No general individual contract filing found in the cited Act. Employer must comply with EPF, ETF and normal employer registration duties.": "引用法令中未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。雇主须遵守EPF、ETF及正常的雇主登记义务。",
  "No general individual contract filing found in the cited Labour Code source. Employer must comply with SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG and BIR registration for every employee.": "引用的劳动法典来源中未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。雇主须为每位员工完成SSS、PhilHealth、Pag-IBIG及BIR登记。",
  "No general individual contract filing found in the cited source. Employer must keep employment records and follow normal registration/tax/pension obligations.": "引用来源中未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。雇主须保存雇佣记录，并遵守正常的登记/税务/养老金义务。",
  "No general individual contract filing found on this page. Normal social security and payroll registration duties still apply.": "本页未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。正常的社会保险及工资登记义务仍然适用。",
  "No general individual contract filing found, but collective work contracts are registered with the Ministry. Non-Jordanian workers need proper work permit approval.": "未发现个人合同的一般备案要求，但集体劳动合同须向部委进行登记。非约旦籍员工需获得适当的工作许可批准。",
  "No general individual contract filing found. Normal SGK (Social Security Institution) notification before work starts is required.": "未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。工作开始前须进行正常的SGK（社会保险机构）通知。",
  "No general individual contract filing. Employer must comply with SARS PAYE, UIF and Compensation Fund registration/reporting duties.": "无需进行个人合同的一般备案。雇主须遵守SARS PAYE、UIF及补偿基金的登记/申报义务。",
  "No general individual contract filing. Employer must handle I-9, W-4, state new-hire reporting, workers compensation and payroll tax duties.": "无需进行个人合同的一般备案。雇主须处理I-9、W-4、州新员工申报、工伤赔偿及工资税义务。",
  "No general individual contract filing. Employer must handle PAYE, NI, workplace pension auto-enrolment and other standard registrations.": "无需进行个人合同的一般备案。雇主须处理PAYE、NI、工作场所养老金自动入会及其他标准登记手续。",
  "No general individual contract filing. Employer must keep employment records and follow normal payroll/tax/social insurance registration.": "无需进行个人合同的一般备案。雇主须保存雇佣记录，并遵守正常的工资/税务/社会保险登记要求。",
  "No general individual contract filing. Employer must keep required employment records and follow normal registration/tax/social security obligations.": "无需进行个人合同的一般备案。雇主须保存所需的雇佣记录，并遵守正常的登记/税务/社会保险义务。",
  "No general individual contract filing. Normal AHV/IV/ALV social insurance and cantonal tax registration apply.": "无需进行个人合同的一般备案。正常的AHV/IV/ALV社会保险及州税登记适用。",
  "No general individual-contract filing found in official source. Normal social security/employer registration still applies.": "官方来源中未发现个人合同的一般备案要求。正常的社会保险/雇主登记仍然适用。",
  "No general individual-contract government filing found. Employers should maintain proper employment records under the Employment Act.": "未发现个人合同的一般政府备案要求。雇主应依据《雇佣法》保存适当的雇佣记录。",
  "No general language rule found in WRC guidance. English or Irish is practical; use clear wording the employee understands.": "WRC指引中未发现一般语言规定。英语或爱尔兰语均可使用；应使用员工能够理解的清晰措辞。",
  "No general language rule found in the cited official source. Use Finnish/Swedish or bilingual wording if the employee needs local-language clarity.": "引用的官方来源中未发现一般语言规定。如员工需要本地语言清晰表述，可使用芬兰语/瑞典语或双语措辞。",
  "No general language rule found. For work permits/foreign workers, official forms may require clear contract details; use a language the worker understands.": "未发现一般语言规定。对于工作许可/外籍员工，官方表格可能要求提供清晰的合同详情；应使用员工能够理解的语言。",
  "No general language rule on the official page. Danish is safest locally; English/bilingual is common for international hires.": "官方页面上无一般语言规定。丹麦语对于本地合规最为稳妥；英语/双语对于国际招聘较为常见。",
  "No general local-language requirement found in the cited Workers' Rights Act extract. English/French are both commonly used in Mauritius employment.": "引用的《劳工权利法》摘录中未发现一般本地语言要求。英语/法语在毛里求斯雇佣中均为常用语言。",
  "No general local-language rule found. If the employee cannot understand the contract language, the employer must explain it in a language the employee understands.": "未发现一般本地语言规定。如员工无法理解合同语言，雇主必须以员工能够理解的语言进行解释。",
  "No general probation clause found in the cited contract-content articles. Use carefully and do not reduce statutory rights.": "引用的合同内容条文中未发现一般试用期条款。使用时须谨慎，不得削减法定权利。",
  "No general probation detail confirmed from the cited official pages. If used, write it clearly and check sector/CBA rules.": "引用的官方页面中未确认一般试用期详情。如使用试用期，须明确书写并核查行业/CBA规定。",
  "No general probation period rule found in the cited contract articles. If used, do not assume it avoids normal employee rights.": "引用的合同条文中未发现一般试用期规定。如使用试用期，不得假定其可规避正常员工权利。",
  "No general requirement for all employment contracts to be in writing under the Labour Code. But written terms are strongly recommended and some special arrangements (project-based, fixed-term) need written documentation.": "《劳动法》对所有劳动合同均无书面形式的一般性强制要求，但强烈建议采用书面条款，且某些特殊安排（如项目制、固定期限）需要书面记录。",
  "No general signing deadline found in CLT article 443. Employer must record employment information in official labour/payroll systems from hiring.": "CLT第443条未规定一般签署截止日期。雇主须自录用之日起在官方劳动/薪资系统中记录用工信息。",
  "No general single-language rule found in the official English guidance. Maltese or English are both official; English is very common for employment in Malta.": "官方英文指引中未见一般性单语言规定。马耳他语和英语均为官方语言；英语在马耳他劳动就业中非常普遍。",
  "No general statutory language rule found. English or Chinese is common; use a language the employee understands.": "未见一般性法定语言规定。英语或中文均属常用；应使用员工能够理解的语言。",
  "No general statutory probation maximum found in the official contract guide. Put any probation terms clearly in writing.": "官方合同指引中未规定一般法定试用期上限。如有试用期条款，须在书面合同中明确载明。",
  "No general written-contract deadline found in official source. Fixed-duration terms should be signed before relying on them.": "官方来源未规定书面合同的一般签署截止日期。固定期限条款应在依赖其效力之前完成签署。",
  "No individual contract filing found in cited articles. Employer must follow mandatory registration and social security obligations.": "所引条款中未见个人合同备案要求。雇主须履行强制性注册及社会保险缴纳义务。",
  "No individual contract filing found in the cited source. Employer registration and payroll/social security obligations still apply.": "所引来源中未见个人合同备案要求。雇主注册及薪资/社保义务仍须履行。",
  "No individual contract filing stated on the official employment-contract page. Employer must handle compulsory pension/health insurance application.": "官方劳动合同页面未规定个人合同备案要求。雇主须办理强制性养老/医疗保险参保手续。",
  "No individual contract filing. Employer must keep a copy of the employment agreement and maintain required payroll/tax records.": "无个人合同备案要求。雇主须保存一份劳动合同副本并维护必要的薪资/税务记录。",
  "No language rule stated on the official English page. German is practical because official forms and local authorities use German.": "官方英文页面未规定语言要求。德语较为实用，因为官方表格及地方主管机关均使用德语。",
  "No later than 1 working day before work starts if the contract was made verbally.": "如合同以口头方式订立，须在工作开始前不晚于1个工作日提供。",
  "No later than 7 calendar days after the employment starts for key information; some extra information may be provided within 1 month.": "关键信息须在就业开始后不晚于7个日历日内提供；部分补充信息可在1个月内提供。",
  "No ordinary labour filing found in the cited source. Employer must keep written particulars for 5 years after termination.": "所引来源中未见普通劳动合同备案要求。雇主须在劳动关系终止后保存书面条款5年。",
  "No separate language rule found in the cited law, but if the employee cannot understand the document language, the written statement must be read/explained to them for validity.": "所引法律中未见单独的语言规定，但若员工无法理解文件所用语言，须将书面声明向其宣读/解释，方可生效。",
  "No simple government deadline found in accessible official English text. Best practice: sign before work starts.": "可查阅的官方英文文本中未见明确的政府截止日期规定。最佳做法：在工作开始前完成签署。",
  "No single compulsory language found in the Basic Conditions of Employment Act English text. Use a language the employee understands; English is common for formal employment.": "《基本就业条件法》英文文本中未规定单一强制性语言。应使用员工能够理解的语言；英语在正式就业中较为普遍。",
  "No single federal probation rule in the cited employment-statement source. Probation cannot remove minimum labour standards.": "所引就业声明来源中未见统一的联邦试用期规定。试用期不得免除最低劳动标准的适用。",
  "No single general deadline found for ordinary full-time indefinite contracts. Written-required contracts/clauses should be signed before the arrangement starts.": "对于普通全职无固定期限合同，未见统一的一般性截止日期规定。需以书面形式订立的合同/条款应在安排生效前完成签署。",
  "No single general language rule found in the official Swedish work.se page. Swedish is standard; English is commonly used in international companies for their Sweden hires.": "官方瑞典work.se页面未规定统一的一般性语言要求。瑞典语为标准用语；英语在国际公司招募瑞典员工时普遍使用。",
  "No single general statutory deadline found in the official Labour Code source. Use written contracts before or at the start of employment.": "官方《劳动法》来源中未规定统一的一般性法定截止日期。应在就业开始前或就业开始时使用书面合同。",
  "No single general statutory probation maximum confirmed from official source; if used, state it clearly and keep statutory rights intact.": "官方来源未确认统一的一般性法定试用期上限；如设有试用期，须明确载明并保留法定权利不受影响。",
  "No single language rule found for private-sector employment in the cited source. Sinhala/Tamil are official languages; English is widely used in business. Use the language the employee understands.": "所引来源中未见适用于私营部门就业的统一语言规定。僧伽罗语/泰米尔语为官方语言；英语在商业中广泛使用。应使用员工能够理解的语言。",
  "No single mandatory language found in the cited Swiss OR provisions. German/French/Italian are all official depending on the canton; use the language most practical for the employee and work location.": "所引瑞士OR条款中未见单一强制性语言规定。德语/法语/意大利语均为官方语言，具体取决于所在州；应使用对员工及工作地点最为实用的语言。",
  "No single national employment-contract language rule found. Use English/local language that the employee understands; state-specific Shops and Establishments rules may add requirements.": "未见统一的全国性劳动合同语言规定。应使用员工能够理解的英语/当地语言；各邦《商店与营业场所条例》可能另有附加要求。",
  "No single official language rule confirmed on the cited page. Luxembourgish, French and German are all official; French is common for employment matters.": "所引页面未确认单一官方语言规定。卢森堡语、法语和德语均为官方语言；法语在劳动就业事务中较为普遍。",
  "No single official-language requirement for KETs/employment contract found in the MOM guidance. English is the de facto standard.": "人力部（MOM）指引中未见关键就业条款（KETs）/劳动合同的单一官方语言要求。英语为事实上的标准用语。",
  "No special language line found on the official English page. Italian is safest for local workers and inspections; bilingual can be used for foreign employees.": "官方英文页面未见特别的语言条款。意大利语对本地员工及劳动检查最为稳妥；外籍员工可使用双语合同。",
  "No specific general probation clause found in the cited Labour Act extract. If used, state it clearly and keep it reasonable.": "所引《劳动法》摘录中未见具体的一般性试用期条款。如设有试用期，须明确载明并保持合理。",
  "No specific language rule found in the cited official Labour Act extract. Nepali is the official language; use it for local compliance.": "所引官方《劳动法》摘录中未见具体语言规定。尼泊尔语为官方语言；应使用尼泊尔语以符合当地合规要求。",
  "No specific language rule found in the official Employment New Zealand page; English is the de facto standard and required for official dealings.": "新西兰就业官方页面未见具体语言规定；英语为事实上的标准用语，且官方事务须使用英语。",
  "No specific official English contract rule confirmed. Urdu is the official language; English is also used in business. Use the language the employee can understand.": "未确认具体的官方英文合同规定。乌尔都语为官方语言；英语亦用于商业往来。应使用员工能够理解的语言。",
  "No specific probation maximum confirmed from the cited official source. If used, state clearly in writing.": "所引官方来源未确认具体的试用期上限。如设有试用期，须以书面形式明确载明。",
  "No specific probation-period rule confirmed from the cited Workers' Rights Act section. If used, state clearly in writing and check Act limits.": "所引《工人权利法》相关条款未确认具体的试用期规定。如设有试用期，须以书面形式明确载明并核查该法规定的上限。",
  "No specific statutory days found in the cited Labour Act article. Best practice: sign before or at the start of employment.": "所引《劳动法》条款中未规定具体的法定天数。最佳做法：在就业开始前或就业开始时完成签署。",
  "No specific statutory deadline found in the cited Termination of Employment Act. Best practice: use written terms before or at the start of employment.": "所引《终止就业法》中未规定具体的法定截止日期。最佳做法：在就业开始前或就业开始时使用书面条款。",
  "No statutory general deadline found in the cited law. Best practice: sign before or at the start of employment.": "所引法律中未规定法定的一般性截止日期。最佳做法：在就业开始前或就业开始时完成签署。",
  "Non-Omani workers must have a work permit and residence card (NEIA). Employment contracts must be consistent with work permit conditions.": "非阿曼籍员工须持有工作许可证及居留证（NEIA）。劳动合同须与工作许可证条件保持一致。",
  "Norway is strict: always have a written contract and always check whether there is a valid ground for fixed-term use.": "挪威要求严格：务必签订书面合同，并始终核查是否存在使用固定期限合同的正当理由。",
  "Norwegian is safest for local compliance. Bilingual contracts are used in international companies in Norway.": "挪威语对当地合规最为稳妥。挪威的国际公司通常使用双语合同。",
  "Not specified in the general labour contract law. Spanish is safest for local evidence and employee understanding.": "一般劳动合同法未作规定。西班牙语对当地举证及员工理解最为稳妥。",
  "Notice of employment must be given immediately after employment starts. Not required if employment lasts no more than 1 month.": "就业通知须在就业开始后立即发出。若就业期限不超过1个月，则无需发出通知。",
  "Notice/contract must include employer and employee details, start date, fixed-term end date if any, notice period, workplace, role/use, pay components, pay date, annual leave, daily/weekly hours, applicable CBA/works agreement, provident fund, trial period, and training entitlement if applicable.": "通知/合同须包含：雇主和员工详情、开始日期、固定期限终止日期（如有）、通知期、工作地点、岗位/用途、薪酬组成、发薪日期、年假、每日/每周工时、适用的CBA/劳资协议、公积金、试用期，以及培训权利（如适用）。",
  "Official Act is in Bangla; no clear general English-contract rule found in official source. Bangla or bilingual is safest for local workers.": "官方法案以孟加拉语撰写；官方来源中未见明确的一般性英文合同规定。孟加拉语或双语对本地员工最为稳妥。",
  "Official LMRA template uses 3 months probation and says the worker cannot be put under probation more than once with the same employer; at least 1 day notice during probation.": "劳工市场监管局（LMRA）官方模板规定试用期为3个月，并规定员工在同一雇主处不得被重复试用；试用期内终止须至少提前1天通知。",
  "Official Lao law is in Lao. Use Lao or bilingual wording for local enforceability; make sure the employee understands the terms.": "老挝官方法律以老挝语撰写。应使用老挝语或双语表述以确保当地可执行性；须确保员工理解合同条款。",
  "Oman: ensure the Arabic contract is ready before or on day one, especially for foreign workers. Keep the contract consistent with the work permit terms.": "阿曼：须确保阿拉伯语合同在入职第一天或之前准备就绪，对外籍员工尤为重要。合同须与工作许可证条款保持一致。",
  "Parties, job/profession, workplace, wage, payment timing, start date, contract duration, probation if used, working hours, annual leave, return-ticket/exit terms where relevant, insurance, end-of-service benefit, and governing law.": "合同须载明：当事方、工作/职业、工作地点、工资、支付时间、开始日期、合同期限、试用期（如有）、工作时间、年假、回程机票/离境条款（如相关）、保险、服务终止福利及适用法律。",
  "Peru: for fixed-term contracts, register with the labour authority within 15 days. Missing the deadline may cause the contract to lose its fixed-term character.": "秘鲁：固定期限合同须在15天内向劳动主管机关进行登记。逾期登记可能导致合同丧失固定期限性质。",
  "Philippines: document probation standards in writing at the start, or the employer will be unable to rely on probation rules.": "菲律宾：须在就业开始时以书面形式记录试用标准，否则雇主将无法援引试用期规定。",
  "Poland is strict: confirm verbal contracts in writing before the first working day. Register with ZUS within 7 days.": "波兰要求严格：须在第一个工作日之前以书面形式确认口头合同。须在7天内向社会保险局（ZUS）完成注册。",
  "Polish is safest for local enforceability and compliance. Bilingual is fine, but Polish should control in disputes.": "波兰语对当地可执行性及合规最为稳妥。双语合同可行，但争议解决应以波兰语版本为准。",
  "Portugal: fixed-term must be documented and registered within 5 business days or you risk it being treated as indefinite.": "葡萄牙：固定期限合同须在5个工作日内完成记录和登记，否则可能被视为无固定期限合同。",
  "Portuguese is safest because official labour records and local enforcement are in Portuguese.": "葡萄牙语最为稳妥，因为官方劳动记录及当地执法均使用葡萄牙语。",
  "Portuguese is safest. If bilingual, Portuguese should control. Law is published in Portuguese.": "葡萄牙语最为稳妥。如为双语合同，应以葡萄牙语版本为准。法律以葡萄牙语颁布。",
  "Practical contract should state parties, role, workplace, start date, pay, working hours, benefits, contract type, leave, confidentiality/IP if needed, and termination/notice terms.": "实用合同应载明：当事方、职位、工作地点、开始日期、薪酬、工作时间、福利、合同类型、假期、保密/IP条款（如需要），以及终止/通知期条款。",
  "Primary essential terms within 7 days from start. Supplementary essential terms within 1 month from start.": "主要必要条款须在就业开始后7天内提供。补充必要条款须在就业开始后1个月内提供。",
  "Primary terms: parties, workplace, job, start/end date, probation, earnings/payment, daily/weekly hours, overtime/shift rules and unpredictable-work rules. Supplementary terms: agency user, training, paid leave, termination procedure/notice/severance, CBA and social security.": "主要条款：当事方、工作地点、职位、开始/终止日期、试用期、薪酬/支付方式、每日/每周工时、加班/轮班规则及不可预见工作规则。补充条款：劳务派遣用工方、培训、带薪休假、终止程序/通知期/遣散费、CBA及社会保险。",
  "Probation can be agreed but must comply with the Labour Standards Act. Contract terms cannot reduce statutory rights during probation.": "可约定试用期，但须符合《劳动基准法》的规定。合同条款不得在试用期内减损法定权利。",
  "Probation can be agreed for up to 3 months. A collective agreement may allow up to 6 months.": "可约定不超过3个月的试用期。集体协议可允许试用期延长至最多6个月。",
  "Probation can be agreed for up to 6 months. Only one probation period per employer.": "可约定不超过6个月的试用期。同一雇主仅可设定一次试用期。",
  "Probation can be agreed in the employment contract for up to 180 days for high-level managers, 60 days for other workers, or 30 days for specified roles. Cannot apply probation more than once for the same job. Do not use a separate probation contract — include probation terms in the employment contract itself or use a probation clause.": "劳动合同中可约定试用期：高级管理人员最长180天，其他员工最长60天，特定岗位最长30天。同一岗位不得重复设定试用期。不得单独签订试用期合同——应将试用期条款纳入劳动合同本身或以试用期条款形式约定。",
  "Probation can be agreed in writing. Note that from April 2026, a new statutory probationary period for unfair dismissal purposes is expected to apply under Employment Rights Bill changes.": "可以书面形式约定试用期。请注意，根据《就业权利法案》修订，预计自2026年4月起，将就不公平解雇目的适用新的法定试用期规定。",
  "Probation can be agreed in writing; check Labour Law limits. Probation alone does not remove statutory rights.": "可以书面形式约定试用期；须核查《劳动法》规定的上限。试用期本身不得免除法定权利。",
  "Probation can be agreed only if included clearly in the contract/written terms and must follow Labour Act limits.": "试用期仅在合同/书面条款中明确载明的情况下方可约定，且须遵守《劳动法》规定的上限。",
  "Probation can be agreed, but it should be clearly written and must follow Labour Contract Law limits based on contract length.": "可约定试用期，但应以书面形式明确载明，且须遵守《劳动合同法》根据合同期限规定的上限。",
  "Probation can be agreed. Standard probation is generally 6 months; some sectors/roles may allow up to 1 year.": "可约定试用期。标准试用期一般为6个月；某些行业/岗位可允许最长1年的试用期。",
  "Probation can be used if agreed. The law confirms probation is counted in service if the worker continues and the contract becomes unlimited.": "经约定可设定试用期。法律确认，若员工继续工作且合同转为无固定期限合同，试用期计入工龄。",
  "Probation can be used only once with the same employer and should be stated clearly. Common official template wording caps probation at 100 working days.": "同一雇主处试用期仅可使用一次，且须明确载明。常见官方模板措辞将试用期上限设为100个工作日。",
  "Probation can be used. Best practice is to state it in writing. Probation cannot be used to dismiss without following fair process.": "可设定试用期。最佳做法是以书面形式载明。不得利用试用期绕过公正程序而解雇员工。",
  "Probation clauses for ordinary employment contracts are generally no longer a standard feature under Belgian law. Do not add probation without checking the exact worker type.": "根据比利时法律，普通劳动合同的试用期条款通常已不再作为标准条款。在未核实具体员工类型的情况下，不得添加试用期条款。",
  "Probation is allowed only if agreed in writing and must follow Labour Code limits.": "试用期仅在以书面形式约定的情况下方可适用，且须遵守《劳动法》规定的上限。",
  "Probation is allowed. State clearly in writing. Employer must give notice before probation end if not passing.": "允许设定试用期。须以书面形式明确载明。若员工未能通过试用，雇主须在试用期结束前发出通知。",
  "Probation is allowed; duration varies by worker category and applicable standing orders. State clearly in writing.": "允许设定试用期；期限因员工类别及适用规章制度而异。须以书面形式明确载明。",
  "Probation is mainly handled by contract/CBA. Check the applicable collective agreement before adding probation wording.": "试用期主要由合同/CBA处理。在添加试用期条款之前，须核查适用的集体协议。",
  "Probation length must be indicated if there is a probation period, including by reference to the applicable collective agreement.": "如设有试用期，须注明试用期长度，包括援引适用的集体协议。",
  "Probation may apply for some employee categories only if validly agreed and aligned with law/CBA.": "试用期仅对特定员工类别适用，且须经有效约定并符合法律/CBA的规定。",
  "Probation may be agreed; state clearly in writing. Ensure the probation wording does not conflict with Termination of Employment of Workmen (Special Provisions) Act protections.": "可约定试用期；须以书面形式明确载明。须确保试用期条款不与《工人就业终止（特别规定）法》所提供的保护相冲突。",
  "Probation may be used if agreed in the contract. State it clearly and make sure it does not remove Employment Act minimum rights.": "如合同中有约定，可设定试用期。须明确载明，并确保其不免除《就业法》规定的最低权利。",
  "Probation must be agreed in writing and cannot be agreed later than the start date.": "试用期须以书面形式约定，且约定时间不得晚于就业开始日期。",
  "Probation must be agreed in writing. Check Labour Code limits for the applicable worker category.": "试用期须以书面形式约定。须核查《劳动法》对适用员工类别规定的上限。",
  "Probation must be agreed in writing. Maximum is 1 month for contracts under 2 years, or 2 months for indefinite or longer fixed-term contracts. No probation for contracts under 6 months.": "试用期须以书面形式约定。合同期限不足2年的，试用期最长为1个月；无固定期限合同或较长固定期限合同的，试用期最长为2个月。合同期限不足6个月的，不得设定试用期。",
  "Probation must be agreed in writing. Maximum probation is 6 months; trial period cannot be agreed for the same worker for the same work again.": "试用期须以书面形式约定。试用期最长为6个月；不得就同一员工从事相同工作再次约定试用期。",
  "Probation must be stated if used. EU predictable-working rules also limit how probation can be handled.": "如设有试用期，须予以载明。欧盟可预见工作规则对试用期的处理方式亦有所限制。",
  "Probation must be stated in the contract. Default cap is 3 months; limited longer periods may be allowed through a collective agreement with a trade union. No probation for employees under 18.": "试用期须在合同中载明。默认上限为3个月；通过与工会签订集体协议，可在有限情况下允许更长的试用期。18岁以下员工不得设定试用期。",
  "Probation must be stated in the contract. Maximum trial period: 3 months for executives and assimilated, 6 weeks for employees, 15 days for manual workers, renewable once.": "试用期须在合同中载明。最长试用期：高管及同等人员为3个月，员工为6周，体力劳动者为15天，可续期一次。",
  "Probation must be written. If not written, normal employment rules apply. Maximum probation is generally 2 months.": "试用期须以书面形式约定。如未以书面形式约定，则适用一般就业规则。试用期一般最长为2个月。",
  "Probation of up to 3 months can be agreed; during probation, 1 week notice for termination applies.": "可约定不超过3个月的试用期；试用期内终止合同须提前1周通知。",
  "Probation of up to 3 months is standard; up to 6 months for trusted workers; up to 1 year for high specialization. State in writing.": "标准试用期最长为3个月；受信任岗位员工最长为6个月；高度专业化岗位最长为1年。须以书面形式载明。",
  "Probation of up to 6 months can be agreed. Only one probation per employer. Shorter notice applies during probation.": "可约定不超过6个月的试用期。同一雇主仅可设定一次试用期。试用期内适用较短的通知期。",
  "Probation of up to 90 days may be agreed in writing and can be extended up to 180 days by agreement. Only one probation period per employer.": "试用期最长可书面约定90天，经协议可延长至180天。每位雇主只能设定一次试用期。",
  "Probation period can be agreed up to 2 months. Can be extended up to 4 months by collective agreement. State clearly in writing.": "试用期可约定最长2个月，经集体协议可延长至4个月。须以书面形式明确说明。",
  "Probation period is generally up to 6 months. Employer must inform the probationary employee of reasonable performance standards at the start. If not properly documented, the worker may be treated as regular.": "试用期一般最长6个月。雇主须在试用期开始时告知试用员工合理的绩效标准。若未妥善记录，员工可能被视为正式员工。",
  "Probation rules apply by law; if special probation wording is used, write it clearly.": "试用期规定依法适用；若使用特殊试用期条款，须以书面形式明确说明。",
  "Probation rules may depend on state law, standing orders and contract. State clearly if used.": "试用期规定可能取决于州法律、常规规章及合同。如适用，须明确说明。",
  "Probation should be clearly stated. Dismissal notice protection generally applies after the probationary worker has been employed over 14 days.": "试用期应明确说明。解雇通知保护通常在试用员工受雇超过14天后适用。",
  "Probation should be stated. Check legal/CBA limits and termination rules.": "试用期应予以说明。须核查法律/CBA限制及终止规定。",
  "Probation should be written clearly and comply with the new Labour Law.": "试用期应以书面形式明确规定，并符合新《劳动法》的要求。",
  "Probation starts after signing. Max 30 days for unskilled work and 60 days for skilled work. Inform the worker in writing before probation ends.": "试用期自签署合同后开始。非技术性工作最长30天，技术性工作最长60天。须在试用期结束前以书面形式通知员工。",
  "Probation/experience contract is a fixed-term contract type and should be written with the correct term.": "试用/见习合同属于固定期限合同类型，应以书面形式写明正确的期限。",
  "Probation/trial work should be documented and kept within Labour Law limits for the worker category.": "试用/试工情况应予以记录，并在劳动法对该类员工规定的限制范围内执行。",
  "Project-based and fixed-term arrangements require proper written documentation to avoid employees being treated as regular.": "项目制和固定期限安排须有适当的书面文件，以避免员工被视为正式员工。",
  "Protective labour laws, collective agreements and extension orders set mandatory minimum conditions and override weaker contract wording.": "劳动保护法律、集体协议及延伸令规定了强制性最低条件，并优先于较弱的合同条款。",
  "Put all important terms in writing, especially wage, benefits, contract duration, probation, working days/rest days, and end-of-contract benefits.": "将所有重要条款以书面形式记录，尤其是工资、福利、合同期限、试用期、工作日/休息日及合同终止福利。",
  "Qatar: always have a written Arabic contract. For foreign workers, issue before departure from the home country.": "卡塔尔：务必签订书面阿拉伯语合同。对于外籍员工，须在其离开本国前签发。",
  "Qatari employer visa/permit process requires the signed employment contract for the foreign worker immigration files.": "卡塔尔雇主的签证/许可证办理流程要求提供已签署的劳动合同，用于外籍员工的移民档案。",
  "Qiwa platform and HRSD registration are part of the official employer/employee administration process. Foreign workers require valid iqama and work permit.": "Qiwa平台和人力资源与社会发展部（HRSD）注册是官方雇主/员工行政管理流程的组成部分。外籍员工须持有效居留证（iqama）和工作许可。",
  "Recommend: parties, job, workplace, wages, working hours, leave, notice, contract type and any agreed conditions. Written contract removes doubt about agreed terms.": "建议包含：双方信息、职位、工作地点、工资、工作时间、假期、通知期、合同类型及任何约定条件。书面合同可消除对约定条款的疑虑。",
  "Recommend: parties, job, workplace, wages, working hours, overtime, leave, probation if any, notice, and fixed-term terms if applicable. Work rules are required to be posted/maintained for establishments with 10+ employees.": "建议包含：双方信息、职位、工作地点、工资、工作时间、加班、假期、试用期（如有）、通知期，以及固定期限条款（如适用）。拥有10名及以上员工的机构须张贴/维护工作规章。",
  "Register the employment contract with the SEPE (Spanish Public Employment Service) within 10 working days of signing.": "须在签署劳动合同后10个工作日内向SEPE（西班牙公共就业服务机构）进行登记。",
  "Romania: zero tolerance for starting work without Revisal registration. The sanction is material and applied per employee.": "罗马尼亚：对未经Revisal注册即开始工作的行为零容忍。处罚措施为实质性的，且按员工人数逐一执行。",
  "Romanian is the official language and safest for local compliance and enforcement.": "罗马尼亚语为官方语言，使用罗马尼亚语对当地合规及执法最为安全。",
  "SEPE registration of fixed-term contracts must be completed within 10 working days after signing.": "固定期限合同须在签署后10个工作日内完成SEPE注册。",
  "Saudi Arabia: use official platforms for contract processing. Arabic version controls. Probation must be written and must not exceed 90 days without extension agreement.": "沙特阿拉伯：使用官方平台处理合同。以阿拉伯语版本为准。试用期须以书面形式规定，未经延期协议不得超过90天。",
  "Saudi Labour Law minimum rights cannot be reduced by contract.": "沙特劳动法规定的最低权利不得通过合同予以削减。",
  "Secure a written agreement before work starts. Nepal's Labour Act explicitly shifts the burden of proof to the employer if no written agreement exists.": "须在工作开始前签订书面协议。尼泊尔《劳动法》明确规定，若不存在书面协议，举证责任将转移至雇主。",
  "Serbia: sign the contract and register before day one. The Central Registry notification is not optional.": "塞尔维亚：须在入职第一天前签订合同并完成注册。向中央登记处提交通知并非可选项。",
  "Serbian is the official language. Use it for local compliance and validity.": "塞尔维亚语为官方语言。应使用塞尔维亚语以符合当地合规要求及确保合同效力。",
  "Should be signed before or at the start of employment; foreign-worker process usually uses LMRA employment contract/work permit workflow.": "应在入职前或入职时签署；外籍员工流程通常使用劳动力市场监管局（LMRA）的劳动合同/工作许可工作流程。",
  "Should include job type, workplace, wages, working hours, leave, notice, contract term if fixed-term, and applicable work rules or collective agreements.": "应包含：职位类型、工作地点、工资、工作时间、假期、通知期、合同期限（若为固定期限）以及适用的工作规章或集体协议。",
  "Should include parties, job title/description, start date, duration if fixed, pay/wages and pay period, hours, leave, sick pay, notice, overtime, housing if applicable, and applicable terms.": "应包含：双方信息、职位名称/描述、入职日期、期限（若为固定期限）、薪酬/工资及发薪周期、工时、假期、病假工资、通知期、加班，以及住房安排（如适用）和适用条款。",
  "Should include parties, job, workplace, start date, duration if fixed, pay, working hours, leave, notice, applicable collective agreement.": "应包含：双方信息、职位、工作地点、入职日期、期限（若为固定期限）、薪酬、工作时间、假期、通知期及适用的集体协议。",
  "Should include parties, job/profession, workplace, start date, duration if fixed, salary, working hours, annual leave, return ticket if applicable for non-Omani, probation, termination notice and end-of-service gratuity terms.": "应包含：双方信息、职位/职业、工作地点、入职日期、期限（若为固定期限）、薪资、工作时间、年假、往返机票（适用于非阿曼籍员工）、试用期、终止通知及服务期满酬金条款。",
  "Sign before employment begins.": "须在入职前签署。",
  "Sign before or at start of work. Fixed-term/duration terms must be written to avoid being treated as indefinite.": "须在工作开始前或开始时签署。固定期限/期限条款须以书面形式规定，以避免被视为无固定期限合同。",
  "Sign before or at the start of work. Fixed-term contracts should be signed before work begins.": "须在工作开始前或开始时签署。固定期限合同应在工作开始前签署。",
  "Simple rule: Hungary needs a written contract, and the two must-have items are base wage and job title.": "简单规则：匈牙利要求签订书面合同，两项必备内容为基本工资和职位名称。",
  "Simple rule: a contract can add detail, but it cannot take away legal minimum rights. Always check NES plus the relevant award/agreement.": "简单规则：合同可添加详细内容，但不得剥夺法定最低权利。务必核查NES及相关奖项/协议。",
  "Simple rule: either give a proper written contract or give the official written notice of conditions. The contract cannot remove mandatory employee rights.": "简单规则：须提供正式的书面合同或官方书面条件通知书。合同不得剥夺员工的法定强制性权利。",
  "Simple rule: issue the written document before work starts, not after.": "简单规则：须在工作开始前（而非开始后）签发书面文件。",
  "Singapore: always issue KETs within 14 days. The content is specific and documented by MOM. Do not skip this step even if no formal written contract is signed.": "新加坡：务必在14天内签发关键就业条款（KETs）。内容须具体，并由人力部（MOM）记录备案。即使未签订正式书面合同，也不得跳过此步骤。",
  "Slovak is the safest for local compliance. Bilingual is used in international companies.": "斯洛伐克语对当地合规最为安全。国际公司通常使用双语合同。",
  "Slovakia: sign before day one. The trial period wording must be in the original contract, not added later.": "斯洛伐克：须在入职第一天前签署合同。试用期条款须写入原始合同，不得事后添加。",
  "Slovenia: sign before day one and complete ZPIZ registration before the employee starts. The two steps are sequential, not optional.": "斯洛文尼亚：须在入职第一天前签署合同，并在员工开始工作前完成ZPIZ注册。这两个步骤须依序完成，不可省略。",
  "Slovenian is the official language. Use it for local compliance and any official filings.": "斯洛文尼亚语为官方语言。应使用斯洛文尼亚语以符合当地合规要求及处理任何官方文件。",
  "Social security, EOBI and other statutory registrations are mandatory. Labour law has specific requirements on maintaining employee records.": "社会保险、雇员旧龄福利机构（EOBI）及其他法定注册为强制性要求。劳动法对员工档案的维护有具体规定。",
  "South Africa: give the written particulars immediately or within the first week. Even if no formal contract is used, the written particulars are mandatory.": "南非：须立即或在入职第一周内提供书面详情。即使未使用正式合同，书面详情也是强制性要求。",
  "South Korea: issue the written working conditions at signing. Do not wait until after the employee starts. The 2-year fixed-term limit is strictly enforced.": "韩国：须在签约时签发书面劳动条件。不得等到员工入职后再签发。2年固定期限限制受到严格执行。",
  "Spain: always register fixed-term contracts with SEPE within 10 days and always state the lawful cause for fixed-term.": "西班牙：务必在10天内向SEPE登记固定期限合同，并务必说明固定期限的合法理由。",
  "Spanish is required. If a foreign-language contract is used, a Spanish version must accompany it for public authorities.": "须使用西班牙语。若使用外语合同，须附上西班牙语版本供公共机构使用。",
  "Spanish is safest because the Labour Code and filing process are in Spanish. No separate English-contract rule found in the cited article.": "使用西班牙语最为安全，因为《劳动法典》及申报流程均以西班牙语进行。在引用的条款中未发现单独的英语合同规定。",
  "Spanish is safest. General contract article does not state an English option; special platform rules require clear Spanish wording.": "使用西班牙语最为安全。一般合同条款未规定英语选项；特殊平台规则要求明确的西班牙语措辞。",
  "Spanish is safest. No separate official language rule found in the cited contract-form articles.": "使用西班牙语最为安全。在引用的合同格式条款中未发现单独的官方语言规定。",
  "Spanish is the official language. No separate English-only rule found. Spanish wording is safest for local compliance.": "西班牙语为官方语言。未发现单独的纯英语规定。使用西班牙语措辞对当地合规最为安全。",
  "Spanish is the official language; all employment documents are in Spanish.": "西班牙语为官方语言；所有就业文件均以西班牙语撰写。",
  "Spanish is the required language. The official contract form and Mexican Federal Labour Law use Spanish.": "西班牙语为规定使用的语言。官方合同格式及墨西哥《联邦劳动法》均使用西班牙语。",
  "Sri Lanka: write a clear employment letter/contract from the start, especially to document probation, pay and notice. Multiple laws apply depending on the sector and worker category.": "斯里兰卡：从一开始就应签订清晰的就业信函/合同，尤其是记录试用期、薪酬和通知期。根据行业和员工类别，适用多项法律。",
  "Standard employment contract can be oral or written. Written form is only required where a law or CBA says so; fixed-term duration must be expressly written.": "标准劳动合同可以是口头或书面形式。仅在法律或CBA有明确规定的情况下才要求书面形式；固定期限须以书面形式明确载明。",
  "State parties, job, workplace, start date, pay, working hours, leave, contract type, probation if any, notice, applicable CBA reference and any other agreed terms.": "应载明：双方信息、职位、工作地点、入职日期、薪酬、工作时间、假期、合同类型、试用期（如有）、通知期、适用的CBA参考及任何其他约定条款。",
  "State parties, job, workplace, start date, pay, working hours, leave, notice, and any benefits. Reference applicable laws and collective agreements where applicable.": "应载明：双方信息、职位、工作地点、入职日期、薪酬、工作时间、假期、通知期及任何福利。如适用，应引用相关法律和集体协议。",
  "State parties, job, workplace, start date, wage, working hours, leave, contract duration, social insurance, termination/notice and any remote/work-policy terms if applicable.": "应载明：双方信息、职位、工作地点、入职日期、工资、工作时间、假期、合同期限、社会保险、终止/通知规定，以及任何远程/工作政策条款（如适用）。",
  "State parties, job, workplace, wage, working hours, leave, contract type, fixed-term end date if applicable, and applicable collective agreement.": "应载明：双方信息、职位、工作地点、工资、工作时间、假期、合同类型、固定期限到期日（如适用）及适用的集体协议。",
  "State parties, role, workplace, start date, pay, working time, leave, notice, employment type, and any clauses that must be written, such as fixed-term/part-time/non-compete where applicable.": "应载明：双方信息、职位、工作地点、入职日期、薪酬、工作时间、假期、通知期、雇用类型，以及任何须以书面形式规定的条款，如固定期限/兼职/竞业限制（如适用）。",
  "State parties, role, workplace, start date, wages, working hours, leave, overtime, benefits, duties, contract term, notice and any collective-agreement terms.": "应载明：双方信息、职位、工作地点、入职日期、工资、工作时间、假期、加班、福利、职责、合同期限、通知期及任何集体协议条款。",
  "State probation terms clearly, keep within law limits, and do not use probation to avoid minimum rights.": "应明确规定试用期条款，保持在法律限制范围内，不得以试用期为由规避最低权利。",
  "Statutory law and sector collective agreements are very important. Contract terms below legal/CBA minimums do not work.": "法定法律和行业集体协议至关重要。低于法律/CBA最低标准的合同条款无效。",
  "Statutory law, works agreements and collective agreements may override weaker contract terms.": "法定法律、劳动协议和集体协议可能优先于较弱的合同条款。",
  "Statutory rights are minimum rights. Collective instruments and legal benefits cannot be waived while employment continues.": "法定权利为最低权利。集体文书和法定福利在雇用关系存续期间不得被放弃。",
  "Sweden: issue the written employment conditions within 7 days of start. Do not rely on the oral agreement alone for anything material.": "瑞典：须在入职后7天内签发书面就业条件。对于任何实质性事项，不得仅依赖口头协议。",
  "Swiss OR mandatory provisions apply. Applicable collective agreements may set additional rights (e.g., minimum wages, leave, notice).": "瑞士《债法典》（OR）强制性规定适用。适用的集体协议可能规定额外权利（例如最低工资、假期、通知期）。",
  "Switzerland is flexible on form, but once a CBA applies, it is hard to contract below it. Check which CBA (if any) covers your industry.": "瑞士在合同形式上较为灵活，但一旦适用CBA，合同条款便难以低于其规定。须核查哪项CBA（如有）适用于您所在的行业。",
  "Taiwan: use a written contract for fixed-term and document the reason. Misusing fixed-term leads to mandatory conversion to indefinite.": "台湾：固定期限合同须使用书面形式并记录原因。滥用固定期限合同将导致被强制转换为无固定期限合同。",
  "Temporary contracts are allowed, but temporary workers cannot receive worse terms than comparable permanent workers without objective reason. Continuous temporary contract generally cannot exceed 2 years.": "允许签订临时合同，但在没有客观理由的情况下，临时员工不得获得比同类永久员工更差的待遇。连续临时合同一般不得超过2年。",
  "Temporary/fixed-term contract must state expected duration or end date.": "临时/固定期限合同须载明预期期限或终止日期。",
  "Temporary/fixed-term status and expected end date or duration should be written clearly.": "临时/固定期限状态及预期终止日期或期限应以书面形式明确说明。",
  "Term must be stated. Work/faena contracts must cover a specific work or project; repeated use for permanent work can be treated as indefinite.": "须载明合同期限。劳务/特定工程合同须针对特定工作或项目；反复用于长期性工作可被视为无固定期限合同。",
  "Terms cannot be less favourable than law or any relevant collective bargaining agreement.": "合同条款不得低于法律或任何相关集体谈判协议的规定。",
  "Thai is safest for local compliance and enforcement. Bilingual contracts are common in international companies.": "使用泰语对当地合规及执法最为安全。国际公司通常使用双语合同。",
  "Thailand: post and maintain work rules for 10+ employee workplaces. Make the probation decision before the end of probation.": "泰国：拥有10名及以上员工的工作场所须张贴并维护工作规章。须在试用期结束前作出试用期决定。",
  "The Netherlands has strong employee-protection rules. The automatic conversion from fixed-term to indefinite after 3 years/3 contracts is a key risk area.": "荷兰拥有强有力的员工保护规定。固定期限合同在3年/3份合同后自动转换为无固定期限合同是一个关键风险领域。",
  "The US is the main at-will exception to the global rule of written employment contracts. But even at-will workers need offer letters, I-9 verification, and payroll setup documentation.": "美国是全球书面劳动合同规则的主要例外，实行随意雇用原则。但即使是随意雇用员工，也需要录用通知书、I-9验证和薪资设置文件。",
  "The contract must point to the correct collective agreement. In Iceland, CBA rules are not optional background rules; they set the floor.": "合同须指向正确的集体协议。在冰岛，CBA规定并非可选的背景规则，而是设定了最低标准。",
  "The must-know point is simple: do not start work without an appointment letter and photo ID card.": "须知要点很简单：未持有任命书和附照片的身份证件，不得开始工作。",
  "The principal written statement must be given on or before the start date (day 1). Additional written particulars can follow within 2 months of start.": "主要书面声明须在入职日期当天或之前提供（第1天）。其他书面详情可在入职后2个月内补充提供。",
  "There is no federal law requiring a written employment contract. Most US employment is at-will. Written contracts are used for executive, specialist and specific agreed roles, or where state law, union contracts or company policy requires.": "美国没有联邦法律要求签订书面劳动合同。美国大多数雇用关系属于随意雇用。书面合同用于高管、专业人员和特定约定职位，或在州法律、工会合同或公司政策有要求的情况下使用。",
  "Three types: indefinite, definite (up to 36 months), and seasonal/specific-task (under 12 months). If a fixed-term contract is renewed more than once for the same job, it converts to indefinite.": "共三种类型：无固定期限、固定期限（最长36个月）以及季节性/特定任务类（12个月以内）。若固定期限合同就同一职位续签超过一次，则转换为无固定期限合同。",
  "Trial period (provanställning) can be agreed for up to 6 months. State it clearly in writing.": "试用期（provanställning）可约定最长6个月。须以书面形式明确说明。",
  "Trial period can be agreed for permanent contracts, typically up to 90/180/240 days depending on the category. No trial period for fixed-term under 6 months. State in writing.": "永久合同可约定试用期，根据类别通常最长为90/180/240天。6个月以下的固定期限合同不设试用期。须以书面形式说明。",
  "Trial period can be agreed for up to 6 months. If trial period is not agreed in writing, it does not apply.": "试用期可约定最长6个月。若试用期未以书面形式约定，则不适用。",
  "Trial period can be agreed in the contract; maximum 6 months. Does not automatically apply.": "试用期可在合同中约定，最长6个月。不自动适用。",
  "Trial period can be agreed in writing; maximum duration depends on category and collective agreement (typically 6 months for qualified workers, 2 months for others).": "试用期可以书面约定；最长期限取决于工种类别和集体协议（通常为技术工人6个月，其他人员2个月）。",
  "Trial period can be agreed. Put it in the contract or written statement, and check any applicable CBA limit.": "可以约定试用期。将其写入合同或书面声明，并核查适用的CBA限制。",
  "Trial period must be agreed in writing at contract conclusion and cannot be added later. Maximum 3 months, or 6 months for senior roles.": "试用期必须在签订合同时书面约定，事后不得追加。最长3个月，高级职位最长6个月。",
  "Trial period must be agreed in writing. Maximum is 3 months (1 month for workers, seasonal/temporary categories). Cannot be used for protected categories such as under-18, pregnant workers.": "试用期必须书面约定。最长3个月（工人、季节性/临时性类别最长1个月）。不得适用于受保护类别，如未成年人、孕妇。",
  "Trial period/probation must be agreed in writing. Maximum is 3 months. State the duration; shorter probation is also possible. Probation is not automatic.": "试用期/见习期必须书面约定。最长3个月。须注明期限；较短的试用期亦可。试用期并非自动适用。",
  "Turkey: for employment lasting 1+ years or where law requires, use a written contract. Give the written conditions document within 2 months even if a verbal contract was used.": "土耳其：雇用期限1年及以上或法律有要求时，须使用书面合同。即使使用了口头合同，也须在2个月内提供书面条件文件。",
  "Turkish is safest for local compliance. Official documents and enforcement are in Turkish.": "使用土耳其语最符合当地合规要求。官方文件和执法均以土耳其语为准。",
  "UAE Labour Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 33 of 2021) minimum rights apply. End-of-service gratuity is mandatory.": "阿联酋《劳动法》（2021年第33号联邦法令）规定的最低权利适用。服务期满奖金为强制性规定。",
  "UAE: always use the official MOHRE contract form. Never use a non-standard format. Register the contract before work starts.": "阿联酋：务必使用MOHRE官方合同格式。切勿使用非标准格式。在开始工作前完成合同登记。",
  "UK: issue the written statement on or before day one. The statement is a legal right, not a courtesy document.": "英国：须在入职第一天或之前发出书面声明。该声明是法定权利，而非礼节性文件。",
  "UNILAV/preliminary recruitment notice to the Employment Centre is part of the official hiring paperwork route.": "向就业中心提交UNILAV/预先招聘通知是官方招聘文件流程的组成部分。",
  "Ukraine: issue the written contract and the employment order, and notify the tax authority before day one. All three steps matter.": "乌克兰：须在入职第一天前签发书面合同和录用令，并通知税务机关。三个步骤缺一不可。",
  "Ukrainian is the official language. Use it for local compliance and any official records.": "乌克兰语为官方语言。用于当地合规及所有官方记录。",
  "Under Ministerial Decree 2022 reforms, all private-sector employment contracts are now fixed-term (maximum 3 years), renewable.": "根据2022年部长令改革，所有私营部门劳动合同现均为固定期限合同（最长3年），可续签。",
  "Uruguay: verbal contracts can be valid, but use a written contract to document pay, hours, leave and termination terms and avoid disputes.": "乌拉圭：口头合同可以有效，但应使用书面合同记录薪酬、工时、休假和终止条款，以避免纠纷。",
  "Use Arabic as the main contract. Give the employee a copy, and add a language they understand for non-Arab workers.": "以阿拉伯语为主要合同语言。给员工一份副本，并为非阿拉伯员工附加其能理解的语言版本。",
  "Use Burmese or bilingual wording. Ministry forms and official processes are in Burmese. Official forms are available from the Township Labour Exchange Office.": "使用缅甸语或双语表述。部委表格和官方程序均以缅甸语为准。官方表格可从乡镇劳动力交流所获取。",
  "Use Lithuanian for local compliance. Bilingual version is practical for foreign employees, but Lithuanian should be safe as the official version.": "使用立陶宛语以符合当地合规要求。双语版本对外籍员工实用，但官方版本应以立陶宛语为准。",
  "Use a French written contract. Be extra careful with CDD: missing written reason or late transmission creates legal risk.": "使用法语书面合同。对CDD须格外谨慎：缺少书面原因或逾期送达会产生法律风险。",
  "Use a signed contract before work starts / work permit processing. Contract handling is tied to Public Authority for Manpower procedures.": "在开始工作/办理工作许可前签署合同。合同处理与劳动力公共管理局程序挂钩。",
  "Use a written contract for any role expected to last 3 months or more. Do not leave salary, hours, leave, notice, or CBA terms vague.": "对于预计持续3个月或以上的职位，须使用书面合同。薪资、工时、休假、通知期或CBA条款不得含糊。",
  "Use the correct worker category: apprentice, substitute, casual, temporary, probationer, permanent, or seasonal, as applicable.": "根据实际情况使用正确的工人类别：学徒、替代工、临时工、临时性工人、见习工、正式工或季节性工人。",
  "Use the official Arabic/bilingual format. Do not rely on an English-only contract for Bahrain.": "使用官方阿拉伯语/双语格式。不得在巴林单独使用英文合同。",
  "Use written contracts even when verbal is allowed, especially for fixed-term workers. The 2-year fixed-term limit matters.": "即使允许口头合同，也应使用书面合同，固定期限工人尤为如此。2年固定期限上限十分重要。",
  "Usually indefinite. Fixed-term is allowed only for listed short-term reasons and must include the expiry date or completion condition. General cap is 5 years including extensions.": "通常为无固定期限。固定期限合同仅在列明的短期原因情形下方可使用，且须注明到期日或完成条件。含续签在内一般上限为5年。",
  "Vietnam: do not sign two consecutive fixed-term contracts — the third must be indefinite or the employee acquires indefinite status. Internal labour regulations must be registered.": "越南：不得签订两份连续的固定期限合同——第三份必须为无固定期限合同，否则员工自动取得无固定期限地位。内部劳动规章须经登记备案。",
  "Vietnamese is required for local compliance. Official contracts and court proceedings are in Vietnamese.": "越南语为当地合规所必须。官方合同和法院程序均以越南语为准。",
  "Wages Boards, Shop and Office Employees Act, and Factories Ordinance set various minimum rights. Contract cannot go below them.": "工资委员会、《商店及办公室雇员法》和《工厂条例》规定了各项最低权利。合同不得低于上述标准。",
  "Within 15 days after the worker starts. Within 5 days for work/service contracts or contracts under 30 days.": "在工人入职后15天内。劳务/服务合同或期限不足30天的合同须在5天内完成。",
  "Within 2 months after employment starts.": "在雇用开始后2个月内。",
  "Within 8 calendar days after the worker starts.": "在工人入职后8个日历日内。",
  "Within the first 2 months after work begins.": "在开始工作后的前2个月内。",
  "Work agreement can be oral or written. But fixed-term work agreements must be written in Indonesian using Latin alphabet.": "劳动协议可以是口头或书面形式。但固定期限劳动协议必须以印度尼西亚语拉丁字母书写。",
  "Work conditions, salary/wages, welfare/benefits, contract duration, start and end date if fixed-term, employer/employee addresses, payment method, probation duration, working days, rest days, holidays, end-of-contract benefits, and any lawful extra terms.": "劳动条件、薪资/工资、福利/待遇、合同期限、固定期限合同的起止日期、雇主/雇员地址、支付方式、试用期期限、工作日、休息日、假期、合同到期福利以及任何合法附加条款。",
  "Worker categories are defined. Fixed-term or specified-period workers should have clear written terms consistent with labour law.": "工人类别已有明确规定。固定期限或特定期限工人应有符合劳动法规定的明确书面条款。",
  "Workers are classified by law and apprenticeship/probation concepts apply; verify exact category and probation wording against Labour Act/Rules before drafting.": "工人按法律分类，学徒期/试用期概念适用；起草前须根据《劳动法》/规则核实确切类别和试用期措辞。",
  "Workers' Rights Act sets minimum rights. Contract cannot go below them.": "《工人权利法》规定了最低权利。合同不得低于上述标准。",
  "Working Environment Act minimum rights and applicable collective agreements cannot be bypassed by contract.": "《工作环境法》规定的最低权利及适用的集体协议不得通过合同予以规避。",
  "Written agreement must include employer name/address/business line, worker name/sex/age/address, job, workplace, wage and payment method, rights/obligations, start date and period, place/date of agreement, and signatures.": "书面协议须包含：雇主名称/地址/经营范围、工人姓名/性别/年龄/地址、工作岗位、工作地点、工资及支付方式、权利/义务、起始日期及期限、协议签订地点/日期以及签名。",
  "Written conditions must be given no later than the first working day, or before the employee departs if working outside the Netherlands.": "书面条件须不迟于第一个工作日提供，若在荷兰境外工作，则须在员工出发前提供。",
  "Written conditions should cover contract parties, job title, job description, work start date, work duration and end date, notice periods, collective agreements or pay grades, holidays, ordinary hours of work and pay details.": "书面条件应涵盖：合同双方、职位名称、岗位描述、工作起始日期、工作期限及终止日期、通知期、集体协议或薪级、假期、正常工作时间及薪酬详情。",
  "Written contract is expected for private-sector employment.": "私营部门雇用须有书面合同。",
  "Written contract is not generally mandatory, but the employer must clearly inform key employment conditions. If the contract is written, give the employee a copy immediately after signing.": "书面合同通常不是强制性的，但雇主必须明确告知主要雇用条件。如合同为书面形式，须在签署后立即给员工一份副本。",
  "Written contract is not strictly required for a valid employment relationship, but employer must give the employee a written statement of particulars.": "书面合同并非有效雇用关系的严格要求，但雇主须向员工提供书面雇用条款说明。",
  "Written contract is required in Arabic and at least 2 copies. If not written, the worker can still prove rights by legal evidence.": "合同须以阿拉伯语书写，至少2份。如未书面签订，工人仍可通过法律证据证明其权利。",
  "Written contract is required in most cases. Short/temporary exceptions exist for certain work not exceeding 90 days, but employer must issue written proof every 30 days if the worker asks.": "大多数情况下须有书面合同。不超过90天的某些短期/临时性工作存在例外，但若工人要求，雇主须每30天出具书面证明。",
  "Written contract is required. The contract is consensual, but it must be put in writing and signed in 2 copies.": "须有书面合同。合同基于双方合意，但必须以书面形式签订，一式2份。",
  "Written contract is strongly required in practice. Under Labour Law No. 14 of 2025, if a contract is not written, it is treated as indefinite.": "实务中强烈建议使用书面合同。根据2025年第14号《劳动法》，若合同未以书面形式签订，则视为无固定期限合同。",
  "Written contract must be made in 3 copies. One copy must be sent to the Ministry of Labour Employment Office within 15 days after signing, changing or renewing it.": "书面合同须一式3份。签订、变更或续签后15天内，须将一份副本送交劳动部就业办公室。",
  "Written contract required for employment lasting 3 months or more. Shorter contracts can be oral, but written terms are safer.": "雇用期限3个月或以上须有书面合同。较短合同可以是口头形式，但书面条款更为安全。",
  "Written document must evidence the contract; best practice includes parties, job, workplace, wages, hours, leave, probation if any, and notice.": "书面文件须作为合同的证明；最佳做法包括记明：双方当事人、岗位、工作地点、工资、工时、休假、试用期（如有）及通知期。",
  "Written document must include: general and special working conditions, daily/weekly working hours, wages, place of payment, labour law conditions, the CBA applicable if any.": "书面文件须包含：一般及特殊劳动条件、每日/每周工作时间、工资、支付地点、劳动法规定条件以及适用的CBA（如有）。",
  "Written employment agreement is required. If no written agreement, the employer bears the burden of proving all terms.": "须有书面劳动协议。如无书面协议，雇主须承担证明所有条款的举证责任。",
  "Written employment agreement/terms are required when employment lasts more than 1 month and averages more than 8 hours per week.": "雇用期限超过1个月且每周平均工作时间超过8小时时，须有书面劳动协议/条款。",
  "Written employment contract / employment document is required if employment lasts at least 1 month and average weekly working time is over 8 hours.": "雇用期限至少1个月且每周平均工作时间超过8小时时，须有书面劳动合同/雇用文件。",
  "Written employment contract is not legally mandated for all workers, but every employee must receive Key Employment Terms (KETs) in writing.": "书面劳动合同并非对所有工人的法律强制要求，但每位员工必须以书面形式收到主要雇用条款（KETs）。",
  "Written employment contract is not strictly required to create a valid employment relationship, but the employer must provide written working-conditions information.": "书面劳动合同并非建立有效雇用关系的严格要求，但雇主须提供书面劳动条件信息。",
  "Written employment contract is required and must be on the official MOHRE-approved form for private-sector employees.": "须有书面劳动合同，私营部门员工须使用MOHRE批准的官方格式。",
  "Written employment contract is required before work starts.": "须在开始工作前签订书面劳动合同。",
  "Written employment contract is required for fixed-term contracts. For indefinite contracts, written is safest and strongly recommended.": "固定期限合同须有书面劳动合同。对于无固定期限合同，书面形式最为安全，强烈建议采用。",
  "Written employment contract is required for fixed-term contracts. For non-Saudi workers, the contract should follow official Musaned/Qiwa workflow.": "固定期限合同须有书面劳动合同。对于非沙特工人，合同应遵循官方Musaned/Qiwa流程。",
  "Written employment contract is required for non-Omani employees. For Omani workers, the contract can be written or oral, but written is recommended.": "非阿曼员工须有书面劳动合同。对于阿曼工人，合同可以是书面或口头形式，但建议采用书面形式。",
  "Written employment contract is required for private-sector employment. Official template/guideline is available from the Ministry of Labour / LMRA.": "私营部门雇用须有书面劳动合同。官方模板/指引可从劳动部/LMRA获取。",
  "Written employment contract is required when the relationship has employment characteristics.": "当关系具有雇用性质时，须有书面劳动合同。",
  "Written employment contract is required, except very short employment lasting no more than 2 weeks. Not writing it does not automatically make the job invalid, but it creates proof risk.": "须有书面劳动合同，但不超过2周的极短期雇用除外。未书面签订不会自动使雇用关系无效，但会产生举证风险。",
  "Written employment contract is required.": "须有书面劳动合同。",
  "Written employment contract is required. Employer and employee are in a contractual relationship when employment begins, but the Labour Code confirms written form requirements.": "须有书面劳动合同。雇用开始时雇主与员工即建立合同关系，《劳动法》确认了书面形式要求。",
  "Written employment contract is required. The employee should not start work before receiving the signed contract copy and NRA notification copy.": "须有书面劳动合同。员工在收到已签署的合同副本和NRA通知副本之前不得开始工作。",
  "Written employment contract is required. The employer must clearly specify working conditions in writing and give the employee a copy.": "须有书面劳动合同。雇主须以书面形式明确规定劳动条件并给员工一份副本。",
  "Written employment contract is required. The employer must ensure it is in writing and give a copy to the employee.": "须有书面劳动合同。雇主须确保合同为书面形式并给员工一份副本。",
  "Written employment contract is required. The law requires that a written labour contract be concluded before work starts.": "须有书面劳动合同。法律要求在开始工作前签订书面劳动合同。",
  "Written employment contract is required. Work cannot start before the contract is registered in the Revisal electronic register.": "须有书面劳动合同。在合同于Revisal电子登记系统完成登记之前，不得开始工作。",
  "Written employment letter/contract is required when employment is for 3 months or more.": "雇用期限3个月或以上时，须有书面雇用函/合同。",
  "Written information must be provided at recruitment or within 30 days after recruitment. For work abroad over 30 days, extra information must be given before departure.": "须在招聘时或招聘后30天内提供书面信息。对于超过30天的境外工作，须在出发前提供额外信息。",
  "Written labour contract is required when an employment relationship is established.": "建立雇用关系时须签订书面劳动合同。",
  "Written labour contract is required, except oral contracts are allowed for seasonal work or specific tasks lasting under 1 month.": "须有书面劳动合同，但季节性工作或期限不足1个月的特定任务允许使用口头合同。",
  "Written notice is generally due within 30 days after the employee starts.": "书面通知通常须在员工入职后30天内发出。",
  "Written notice/agreement should cover the main working conditions: parties, job, supervisor/reporting, start date, pay, working hours/rest, leave, social benefits/pension, notice and applicable collective/extension orders.": "书面通知/协议应涵盖主要劳动条件：双方当事人、岗位、上级/汇报关系、起始日期、薪酬、工作时间/休息、休假、社会福利/养老金、通知期以及适用的集体/延伸令。",
  "Written particulars must be given at the start of employment or within the first week.": "书面条款须在雇用开始时或第一周内提供。",
  "Written particulars must be given within 2 months after employment starts.": "书面条款须在雇用开始后2个月内提供。",
  "Written particulars must include employer/employee details, job description, start date, ordinary hours/days, wage, overtime, pay period, other payment terms, leave entitlements, sick leave, notice, and fixed-term end date if applicable.": "书面条款须包含：雇主/雇员详情、岗位描述、起始日期、正常工时/工作天数、工资、加班、支付周期、其他支付条款、休假权利、病假、通知期以及固定期限终止日期（如适用）。",
  "Written statement of conditions must be given within 3 months after employment starts.": "条件书面声明须在雇用开始后3个月内提供。",
  "Written statement should follow Schedule I: worker/employer details, appointment date, job title, pay and pay interval, hours and overtime, leave, sickness/injury conditions, notice period and social security/pension details.": "书面声明应遵循附表一格式：工人/雇主详情、任命日期、职位名称、薪酬及支付周期、工时及加班、休假、疾病/伤害条件、通知期以及社会保障/养老金详情。",
  "Written terms are important. Official Cyprus labour guidance highlights written contracts for foreign employees; local employment terms are also heavily shaped by law and collective agreements.": "书面条款至关重要。塞浦路斯官方劳动指引强调外籍员工须有书面合同；当地雇用条款亦受法律和集体协议的重大影响。",
  "Written terms can refer to collective agreements/REA/ERO where allowed. Legal minimums and applicable agreements override weaker terms.": "书面条款在允许的情况下可参照集体协议/REA/ERO。法定最低标准及适用协议优先于较低标准的条款。"
};
